  <para style="h">Abalewi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca gatatu ca Mose citwa Abalewi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abalewi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lew</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca gatatu ca Mose citwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Abalewi</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ikimazi co guturirwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahamagara Mose ari mw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro, aramubwira ati: <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />“Vugana n’Abisirayeli ubabwire uti: ‘Umuntu wese muri mwebwe azogomba gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ishikanwa, azomushikanire igitungwa akuye mu bitungwa bininibinini canke bitobito.<verse eid="LEV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />Ico kimazi nicaba ari ico guturirwa kivuye mu bitungwa bininibinini, gitegerezwa kuba ari ishuri itagira agasembwa. Aze akijane imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro kugira ngo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amwemere. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Aze arambike ikiganza ciwe ku mutwe w’ico kimazi co guturirwa, hanyuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azokwemera ko gipfuye mu gishingo ciwe ngo kibe impongano y’ivyaha vyiwe. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Azoce akererera iyo shuri imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, maze abaherezi bene Aroni baze bazane amaraso yayo bayamije ku mpande zose z’igicaniro imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Hanyuma azoce akura urusato kuri ico kimazi, agicemwo ibihimba. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />Abahungu ba Aroni umuherezi bazoce bacana umuriro ku gicaniro bashireko inkwi. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />Hanyuma abo baherezi bene Aroni baze bashire vya bihimba vyose kuri za nkwi ziri ku gicaniro, harimwo umutwe n’ibinure vyaco. <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" />Aze yogeshe amazi ivyo mu nda n’amaguru, hanyuma umuherezi abituririre vyose ku gicaniro, nk’ikimazi co guturirwa, gitanzwe biciye mu guturirwa, ishikanwa rimota neza rinezera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />Ico kimazi nicaba ari ico guturirwa kivuye mu mukuku, ari impene canke intama, aze atange isuguru itagira agasembwa. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Aze ayikererere ku ruhande ruherereye mu buraruko bw’igicaniro imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, hanyuma abaherezi bene Aroni baze bamijagire amaraso y’iyo suguru ku mpande zose z’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />Aze ayihimbaguremwo ibihimba, hanyuma umuherezi abitondeke ku nkwi ziriko zirakira ku gicaniro, harimwo umutwe n’ibinure vyayo. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Aze yogeshe amazi ivyo mu nda n’amaguru, hanyuma umuherezi abituririre vyose ku gicaniro, nk’ikimazi co guturirwa, gitanzwe biciye mu guturirwa, ishikanwa rimota neza rinezereza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />Ico kimazi co gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nicaba ari ico guturirwa kivuye mu biguruka, aze atange inuma canke intunguru ikiri nto. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Umuherezi aze ayizane ku gicaniro, ayihotore izosi, ayice umutwe, awuturirire ku gicaniro, hanyuma areke amaraso yayo atembere ku ruhande rumwe rw’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />Aze akureko agatorero n’ibirimwo vyose agaterere ku ruhande rwo mu buseruko bw’igicaniro, ahari umunyota. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Aze asaturemwo kubiri iyo nyoni, ayisaturire hagati y’amababa mu gukwega umubiri wayo, ariko ntaze atandukanye ivyo bice bibiri, hanyuma umuherezi aze ayituririre ku nkwi ziriko zirakira ku gicaniro, nk’ikimazi co guturirwa, gitanzwe biciye mu guturirwa, ishikanwa rimota neza rinezereza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ishikanwa ry’ifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />Nihagira uwushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ishikanwa ry’ivyimburwa bivamwo ifu, ishikanwa ryiwe rize ribe iry’ifu inoze neza. Aze ayisukeko amavuta, ashireko n’ibimota neza, <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />hanyuma ayishire abaherezi bene Aroni. Umuherezi aze ayore ifu yuzuye urushi kuri ya fu inoze neza ivanze n’amavuta hamwe na vya bimota neza, abituririre ku gicaniro kugira ngo ako gace kabe icibutso, ishikanwa rituriwe rimota neza rinezereza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Ibisigaye kuri iryo shikanwa ry’ibivamwo ifu, ni ivya Aroni n’abahungu biwe; ni igice cejejwe kurusha ibindi mu mashikanwa ashikanirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yo guturirwa n’umuriro.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />Nimwatanga ishikanwa ry’ivyokejwe, rize ribe umukate ucumbwe mw’ifu inoze neza: udukate tutarimwo umwambiro kandi tuvanze n’amavuta ya elayo, canke udukate tutarimwo umwambiro tw’intimba nto tumijagiwe amavuta ya elayo. <verse eid="LEV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />Nimba ishikanwa ryawe ari udukate twokejwe kw’ipano, tuze tube dukozwe mw’ifu inoze neza ivanzwe n’amavuta kandi itarimwo umwambiro. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Uzotumanyuremwo utumanyu dutoduto hanyuma udusukeko amavuta; iryo rizoba ari ishikanwa ry’ifu. <verse eid="LEV 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />Nimba ishikanwa ryawe ritetswe kw’ipano, rize ribe rigizwe n’ifu inoze neza ivanze n’amavuta ya Elayo. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Ishikanwa iryo ari ryo ryose rivuye mu biterwa bivamwo ifu ushikaniye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uzorihe umuherezi, na we azorijana ku gicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Aze akureko igice c’icibutso agituririre ku gicaniro nk’ishikanwa ryo guturirwa, ritanzwe biciye mu guturirwa, ishikanwa rimota neza rinezera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Ibisigaye kuri iryo shikanwa ry’ibivamwo ifu, ni ivya Aroni n’abahungu biwe; ni igice cejejwe kurusha ibindi mu mashikanwa ashikanirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yo guturirwa n’umuriro.<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />Ishikanwa ryose rivuye mu vyimburwa bivamwo ifu muzoshikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rize ribe ritarimwo umwambiro, kuko mudakwiye guturira umwambiro canke ubuki mw’ishikanwa mushikaniye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Ivyo muzoshobora kubishikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’amashikanwa y’ivyeze imbere y’ibindi, atari amashikanwa atuririwe ku gicaniro nk’ikimazi kimota neza. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />Muze murunge umunyu mu mashikanwa yanyu yose avuye mu vyimburwa. Ntimuze mwibagire gushiramwo umunyu kuko umunyu werekana isezerano riri hagati y’Imana yanyu namwe. Muze mushiremwo umunyu mu mashikanwa yanyu yose avuye mu vyimburwa bivamwo ifu.<verse eid="LEV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />Nimwashikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amashikanwa avuye mu vyimburwa bivamwo ifu vyimbuwe ubwa mbere, muze mufate imikama y’ingano mukuye mu mirima, muzotse ku muriro, hanyuma intete zazo muzisye. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />Muze mwongereko amavuta n’ibimota neza; rizoba ribaye ishikanwa rivuye mu vyimburwa bivamwo ifu. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Umuherezi aze akureko igice c’icibutso, agituririre hamwe na ya mavuta na vya bimota neza, iryo ni ishikanwa rishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku gicaniro.<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ikimazi c’ishimwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />Niwatanga ikimazi c’ishimwe kivuye mu bitungwa bininibinini, uze ushikane imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ishuri canke inka ivyara, ariko itagira agasembwa. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />Uwutanze ico kimazi aze arambike ikiganza ciwe ku mutwe waco hanyuma agikererere ku muryango w’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro. Maze abaherezi bene Aroni baze bamijagire amaraso yaco ku mpande zose z’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Aze akure kuri ico kimazi c’ishimwe ivyo gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’ishikanwa ryo guturirwa n’umuriro rigizwe n’ibi bikurikira: ibinure vyose bifatanye n’ivyo mu nda, <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />amafyigo yompi n’ibinure biri kuri yo n’ibiri ku mbavu hamwe n’igice cose gipfutse igitigu, ico azokuranako n’amafyigo. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Ivyo vyose bene Aroni baze babituririre ku gicaniro, hejuru y’ikimazi co guturirwa kigeretse ku nkwi; iryo ni ishikanwa rituriwe n’umuriro, rimota neza, rinezereza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />Naho niyatanga ikimazi c’ishimwe kivuye mu bitungwa bitobito nk’ikimazi ashikaniye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kizobe ari isuguru canke iyivyara, ariko itagira agasembwa. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Niyatanga intama, aze ayijane imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />ashire ikiganza ku mutwe wayo imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro, hanyuma ayikererereho. Maze abaherezi bene Aroni baze bamijagire amaraso yayo ku mpande zose z’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Kuri ico kimazi c’ishimwe aze ashikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ishikanwa ryo guturira ku gicaniro rigizwe n’ibi bikurikira: ibinure vyaco, umurizo wose uko bazoba bawukuye ku ruti rw’umugongo, ibinure vyose bifatanye n’ivyo mu nda, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />amafyigo yompi n’ibinure biri kuri yo n’ivyo mu mbavu, n’igice gipfutse igitigu, ico azokurirako rimwe n’amafyigo. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Umuherezi aze abituririre ku gicaniro nk’imfungurwa zituriwe n’umuriro zishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />Ico kimazi nicaba ari impene, aze akizane imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />arambike ikiganza ciwe ku mutwe waco hanyuma agikererere imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro. Aze aheze amijagire amaraso yaco ku mpande zose z’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />Ku kimazi yatanze aze akureko ishikanwa ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryo guturirwa n’umuriro ry’ibihimba bikurikira: ibinure vyose bipfutse ivyo mu nda canke ibifatanye na vyo, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />amafyigo yompi n’ibinure biri kuri yo n’ivyo mu mbavu, n’igice gipfutse igitigu, ico azokurirako rimwe n’amafyigo. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Umuherezi aze abituririre ku gicaniro nk’imfungurwa zishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bibe ishikanwa rimota neza. Ibinure vyose ni ivy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />Iri ni ibwirizwa ry’intahava uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikirana n’urundi, aho muzoba muri hose: ntimuze murye ibinure canke amaraso.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" />“Bwira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Umuntu niyacumura atabiteguye, agakora ibinyuranye n’ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uku ni ko bizohora bigenda:<verse eid="LEV 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />Abaye ari umuherezi yarobanujwe amavuta yacumuye, akazanira abantu gutsindwa n’urubanza, aze ashikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ishuri itagira agasembwa kw’ikimazi atangiye icaha yakoze. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Aze azane iyo shuri mu rwinjiriro rw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, arambike ikiganza ciwe ku mutwe wayo hanyuma ayikererere imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Hanyuma uwo muherezi yarobanujwe amavuta aze afate igice c’amaraso y’iyo shuri ayatware mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro. <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />Aze akoze urutoke rwiwe muri ayo maraso aheze ayamijagire incuro indwi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, imbere y’igihuzu gikingiriye ahera ho mw’ihema. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Umuherezi aze yongere afate ikindi gice c’amaraso ayasige ku mahembe y’igicaniro baturirirako ibimota neza kiri imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro. Amaraso asigaye y’iyo shuri aze ayasuke i ruhande y’igicaniro co guturirirako ibimazi kiri mu rwinjiriro rw’ihema ry’ibonaniro. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />Aze akureko ibinure vyose kuri iyo shuri itangiwe ivyaha: ibinure vyose bifatanye n’ivyo mu nda, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />amafyigo yompi n’ibinure biri kuri yo n’ibifatanye n’imbavu, igice kiri hejuru y’igitigu, ico azokuranamwo n’amafyigo, <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />nka kurya ibinure bikurwa ku mpfizi itangwa kw’ikimazi c’ishimwe. Umuherezi aze abituririre ku gicaniro co guturirirako ibimazi. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Ariko urusato rw’iyo shuri, inyama zayo, umutwe, amaguru, ivyo mu nda vyose n’insogi, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" />ni ukuvuga ibisigaye vyose vyo kuri yo; aze abifate abijane inyuma y’aho mucumbitse mu kibanza gihumanuwe, ahatabwa umunyota, abiturire n’umuriro ku nkwi zigeretse ku kirundo c’umunyota.<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />Igihe Abisirayeli bose ari bo bazoba bacumuye ariko batabishaka, bagakora ibinyuranye n’ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, naho abantu bose batomenya ko bacumuye, bazoba ari abo gutsindwa n’urubanza. <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />Nibamara gutahura icaha bakoze, Abisirayeli bose baze bazane ishuri kw’ikimazi c’ivyaha bayishikane imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />Abakuru bo mu Bisirayeli baze barambike ibiganza vyabo ku mutwe w’iyo shuri imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, hanyuma iyo shuri ikerererwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Umuherezi yarobanujwe amavuta aze afate igice c’amaraso y’iyo shuri ayajane mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro. <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />Aze akoze urutoke rwiwe muri ayo maraso aheze ayamijagire incuro indwi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, imbere y’igihuzu gikingiriye ahera ho mw’ihema. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />Aze asige igice c’ayo maraso ku mahembe y’igicaniro kiri imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro. Amaraso asigaye aze ayasese hasi i ruhande y’igicaniro co guturirirako ibimazi kiri mu rwinjiriro rw’ihema ry’ibonaniro. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />Aze akureko ibinure vyose kuri ico kimazi aheze abituririre ku gicaniro, <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />hanyuma ibisigaye abikore nk’uko bikorwa kw’ishuri y’ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha. Uko ni ko umuherezi azotangira impongano ikoraniro ry’Abisirayeli, kandi bazoharirwa ivyaha vyabo. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Hanyuma aze afate ibice bisigaye vy’iyo shuri abikure aho bakoraniye, abiturire nk’uko bikorwa kw’ishuri itangirwa umuherezi yarobanujwe amavuta. Ico ni ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha vy’ikoraniro ry’Abisirayeli ryose.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />Uwurongoye abandi mu Bisirayeli niyacumura atabishaka, agakora ibinyuranye n’ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yiwe, ariko we ntamenye ko yacumuye, na ho nyene azoba ari uwo gutsindwa n’urubanza. <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />Niyamara gutahura icaha yakoze, aze azane ikimazi c’isuguru y’impene itagira agasembwa, <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />hanyuma arambike ikiganza ciwe ku mutwe wayo, ace ayikererera aho bakererera ibimazi bituririrwa imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ico ni ikimazi c’ivyaha. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Hanyuma umuherezi aze afate igice c’amaraso y’ico kimazi c’ivyaha ayasigishe urutoke ku mahembe y’igicaniro co guturirirako ibimazi hanyuma asese ayasigaye hasi i ruhande y’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Aze aturirire ibinure vyayo vyose ku gicaniro nk’uko baturira ibinure vy’ikimazi c’ishimwe. Uko ni ko umuherezi azotanga impongano y’icaha c’uwo mukuru mu Bisirayeli, kandi na we azoharirwa.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />Abaye ari umuntu asanzwe muri mwebwe acumuye atabishaka, agakora ibinyuranye n’ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, naho atoba abizi ko yacumuye, na ho nyene azoba ari uwo gutsindwa n’urubanza. <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />Niyamara gutahura icaha yakoze, aze atange impene y’ishashi itagira agasembwa nk’ikimazi c’icaha ciwe. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Aze arambike ikiganza ku mutwe w’ico kimazi c’ivyaha hanyuma agikererere mu kibanza c’ibimazi biturirwa n’umuriro. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Hanyuma umuherezi aze afate igice c’amaraso y’ico kimazi ayasigishe urutoke ku mahembe y’igicaniro co guturirirako ibimazi hanyuma asese ayasigaye hasi i ruhande y’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />Aze akureko ibinure vyose, nk’uko bigenda ku kimazi c’ishimwe, maze umuherezi abituririre ku gicaniro c’ishikanwa rimota neza rinezereza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Uko aze abe ari ko umuherezi amutangira impongano, na we azoharirwa.<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />Naho niyatanga umwagazi w’intama kw’ikimazi c’icaha, aze atange iyivyara itagira agasembwa. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />Aze arambike ikiganza ku mutwe w’ico kimazi hanyuma agikererere aho basanzwe bakererera ibimazi nk’ivyo bitangirwa ivyaha. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Hanyuma umuherezi aze yakire igice c’amaraso y’ico kimazi gitangiwe icaha, ayasigishe urutoke ku mahembe y’igicaniro co guturirirako ibimazi, asese ayasigaye hasi i ruhande y’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />Aze akure ibinure vyose kuri ico kimazi nk’uko ibinure bisanzwe bikurwa ku mwagazi w’intama utanzwe kw’ikimazi c’ishimwe, hanyuma umuherezi abituririre ku gicaniro hejuru y’amashikanwa ashikanirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Uko ni ko umuherezi azomutangira impongano y’icaha yakoze, na we azoharirwa.<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />Umuntu niyahamagarwa ngo abe icabona, avuge ivyo yabonye canke azi, akanka kubivuga, bizomubera icaha, kandi ico caha aze agihanirwe.<verse eid="LEV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />Umuntu niyakora ku kintu gihumanye, nko ku muvyimba w’igikoko gihumanye caba ico mw’ishamba canke igitungano canke igikwega inda hasi, naho yoba atabimenye, azoba abaye uwuhumanye kandi azoba atsinzwe n’urubanza. <verse eid="LEV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />Canke umuntu niyakora ku bihumanya biva mu muntu, ibintu vyose bishobora gutuma umuntu ahumana, naho yoba atabizi, igihe azobimenyera azoba atsinzwe n’urubanza. <verse eid="LEV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />Umuntu niyasezerana canke akarahira atavyiyumviriye neza, akemera gukora ikintu, ari kibi canke ciza, naho yobigira atabizi, igihe azobimenyera azoba atsinzwe n’urubanza. <verse eid="LEV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />Umuntu niyashikirwa no gutsindwa n’urubanza mu buryo bumwe muri ubwo, aze yature ingene yacumuye, <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />hanyuma atange impongano y’icaha yakoze, ashikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ishashi y’intama canke y’impene ivuye mu mukuku wiwe nk’ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha. Umuherezi na we aze ayimutangire kw’incungu y’icaha ciwe.<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />Niyaba adashobora kuronka umwagazi w’intama, aze ashikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> intunguru zibiri canke inuma zibiri nk’impongano y’icaha ciwe; imwe itangwe nk’ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha, iyindi itangwe nk’ikimazi co guturirirwa ku gicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Aze abizanire umuherezi, na we aze atangurire ku gutanga ikimazi c’ivyaha. Aze ahotore izosi ariko ntaritandukanye n’umutumba, <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />hanyuma aze amijagire igice c’amaraso y’ico kimazi gitangiwe ivyaha ku ruhande rumwe rw’igicaniro, ayandi maraso asigaye aze ayasese atembe hasi i ruhande y’igicaniro. Ico ni ikimazi co gutangirwa ivyaha. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Umuherezi aze aheze atange iya kabiri kw’ikimazi co guturirirwa ku gicaniro mu buryo bwashinzwe kugira ngo amutangire impongano y’icaha yakoze, na we azobabarirwa.<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />Ariko niyaba adashobora kuronka izo ntunguru canke izo numa, aze azane ic’icumi c’ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ikilo 1,6.</char></note> y’ifu inoze neza ayitange kw’ikimazi gitangirwa icaha. Ntaze ayisukeko amavuta canke ngo ayishireko ibimota neza, kuko ari ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Aze ayishire umuherezi, na we azoce akurako ifu yuzuye igipfunsi, nk’agace gatoya k’icibutso, ayituririre ku gicaniro hejuru y’amashikanwa yo guturirwa ashikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Izoba ibaye ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Uko ni ko umuherezi azomutangira impongano y’icaha cose muri ivyo azoba yakoze, na we azobabarirwa. Ibisigaye kuri iryo shikanwa bizoba ari ivy’uwo muherezi, nk’uko bigenzwa ku mashikanwa y’ifu.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikimazi c’indishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />“Umuntu niyacumura atabishaka agakora ikizira ku bijanye n’ivyera vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aze ashikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikimazi c’indishi, kizobe ari impfizi y’intama akuye mu bitungwa vyiwe, arabe iyitagira agasembwa kandi igiciro cayo kizobe gikwiranye n’igiciro c’ifeza, ukoresheje ingero shekeli y’Ahera.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 12.</char></note> Ico kizoba ari ikimazi c’indishi. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Ategerezwa kandi gusubiza agaciro ico kintu co mu vyera vy’Uhoraho yahumanije mu kwongerako ica gatanu c’igiciro caco. Aze abishikirize umuherezi, na we amaze kumutangira ico kimazi c’indishi, azoca ababarirwa.<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />Umuntu niyacumura ku cagezwe na kimwe c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, naho atoba yabimenye, azoba ari uwo gutsindwa n’urubanza kandi azobihanirwa. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Aze ashire umuherezi impfizi y’intama akuye mu mukuku, itagira agasembwa kandi ifise igiciro gikwiye nk’uko bitegerezwa. Umuherezi aze amutangire ico kimazi c’indishi muri ubwo buryo, na we azobabarirwa. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Kizoba ari ikimazi c’indishi, kuko azoba yatsinzwe n’urubanza mu gucumura k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" />“Umuntu niyacumura k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu guhemukira umubanyi wiwe, nk’akarorero akabesha ku vyerekeye ikintu yamugwatirije, yamutijije, yamwivye canke yamurenganije, <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" />canke agatora ivyatakaye hanyuma ntamubwize ukuri ariko akarahira abesha, canke na ho agakora icaha co kuba icabona c’ibinyoma aho kuvugisha ukuri, canke agakora icaha ico ari co cose gisa n’ivyo; <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" />niyacumura mu buryo na bumwe muri ubwo, azoba ashikiwe no gutsindwa n’urubanza. Aze asubize ico yivye canke yatwaye ku karenganyo, canke yari yagwatirijwe canke icari catakaye yatoye, <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />canke ico yari yarahiriye ibinyoma. Aze agisubize nyene co cose gikwiye, yongereko ica gatanu c’igiciro caco. Azogitange ku musi wo gutangirako ikimazi co gutunganya. <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />Mu gutanga ico kimazi c’indishi k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aze ashire umuherezi impfizi y’intama itagira agasembwa ivuye mu mukuku kandi ifise igiciro gikwiranye n’iyo ndishi. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Uko azobe ari ko umuherezi amutangira ikimazi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na we azobabarirwa ku co yakoze catumye aba uwo gutsindwa n’urubanza.”<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikimazi giturirwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />“Barira Aroni n’abahungu biwe uti: ‘Aya ni yo mabwirizwa agenga ibimazi vyo guturirwa: Ikimazi co guturirwa kize kigume ku gicaniro ijoro ryose gushika mu gitondo, kandi umuriro uze ugume waka ku gicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Umuherezi aze yambare impuzu ziwe zera, n’impuzu zo musi zera, hanyuma akure umunyota w’ico kimazi camaze guturirwa n’umuriro ku gicaniro awushire i ruhande y’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Maze azoce akura za mpuzu yambare izindi, hanyuma asohore wa munyota awujane inyuma y’aho mucumbitse awushire mu kibanza kidahumanye. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Umuriro wo ku gicaniro uze ugume waka, ntuze uzime. Mu gitondo umuherezi aze yame yongerako inkwi yongere ashireko ikimazi co guturirwa, aturire n’ibinure vy’ikimazi c’ishimwe. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Umuriro uze ugume waka ku gicaniro, ntuze uzime.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ishikanwa ry’ifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />Ibi ni vyo vyashinzwe ngo bigenge ishikanwa ry’ivyimburwa bivamwo ifu: Aroni n’abahungu biwe baze barishikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> imbere y’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Umuherezi aze ayore urushi rw’ifu inoze neza ayivange n’amavuta ya elayo hamwe n’ibimota neza, abijane ku gicaniro, hanyuma aturirire ku gicaniro ako gace kugira ngo kabe icibutso, ubumote bwiza bunezera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Aroni n’abahungu biwe baze barye iyisigaye, ariko baze bayirye batayivanze n’umwambiro kandi bayirire mu kibanza cejejwe, mu rugo rw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Ntize ikaranganwe n’umwambiro. Ndayibahaye nk’umugabane wabo kuri ayo mashikanwa banshikanira. Nk’uko biri ku kimazi c’ivyaha n’ikimazi c’indishi, ico kimazi kizoba icejejwe cane. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Umuhungu wese ava mu ruvyaro rwa Aroni ashobora kukiryako. Uwo ni umugabane wiwe w’imisi yose ku mashikanwa yo guturirwa ashikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikirana n’urundi. Ikintu cose kizokora kuri iryo shikanwa kizoba cerejwe Uhoraho.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yongera kubwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />“Iri rize ribe ishikanwa Aroni n’abahungu biwe bazoshikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku musi bazoba barobanujwe amavuta: ic’icumi c’ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ikilo 1,6.</char></note> y’ifu inoze neza itangwa nk’ishikanwa ry’ifu ryama ritangwa ku musi, igice caryo aze agitange mu gitondo ikindi gice ku mugoroba. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Uze uyivange n’amavuta ya elayo hanyuma uyikarange kw’ipano, hanyuma ubizane bivanze neza bishikanwe nk’ishikanwa ry’ifu riri mu tumanyu dutoduto, ribe ubumote bwiza bunezera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Umuhungu wiwe azomusubirira nk’umuherezi asizwe amavuta azobe ari we aritegura. Iryo ni ishikanwa rizokwamaho kandi ritegerezwa guturirwa ryose ntihagire igisigara. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Ishikanwa ry’ifu ritanzwe n’umuherezi rize riturirwe rihere; ntirize riribweko na gatoya.”<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />“Bwira Aroni n’abahungu biwe uti: ‘Ibi ni vyo vyagezwe bigenga ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha: ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha kize gikerererwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aho ikimazi co guturirwa gikerererwa, kizoba ari icera cane. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Umuherezi agishikanye aze akirye, akirire mu kibanza cejejwe, mu rugo rw’ihema ry’ibonaniro. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Kandi ikintu cose kizokora ku nyama zaco kizoba kibaye icera, kandi amaraso yaco niyatarukira ku mpuzu, uze uyimesurire ahantu hera. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Inkono y’ibumba izoteka izo nyama izoce imenwa. Ariko nizatekwa mu nkono ikozwe mu mwakaka, ize yozwe hanyuma irongororwe mu mazi. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Umuhungu wese wo mu muryango w’uwo muherezi aze akiryeko; kizoba ari icera cane. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Ariko ikimazi c’ivyaha ntikize kiribwe igihe amaraso yaco azoba yazanywe mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro Ahera nk’ikimazi c’ivyaha. Kize giturirwe mu muriro.<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ikimazi c’indishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />Ibi ni vyo vyagezwe bigenga ikimazi c’indishi, kandi ni icera cane. <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Ikimazi c’indishi kize gikerererwe ahategekanirijwe ico gikorwa, hanyuma amaraso yaco aze amijagirwe ku mpande zose z’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Ibinure vyaco vyose bize bishikanwe ku gicaniro: umurizo n’ibinure vyose bipfutse ivyo mu nda, <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />amafyigo yompi n’ibinure biri kuri yo n’ibiri ku mbavu hamwe n’igice cose gipfutse igitigu, ico azokuranako n’amafyigo. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Umuherezi aze abituririre ku gicaniro nk’ishikanwa ryo guturirwa rishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rituriwe mu muriro. Kizoba ari ikimazi c’indishi. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Umuhungu wese wo mu muryango w’uwo muherezi aze akiryeko, ariko baze bakirire ahantu hera, kuko kizoba ari icera cane.<verse eid="LEV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />Ivyagezwe vyerekeye ikimazi c’ivyaha n’ikimazi c’indishi birasa: ivyo bimazi vyose ni ivy’umuherezi yabitanze nk’ikimazi c’impongano. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Umuherezi atangiye umuntu ikimazi co guturirwa, urusato rwaco ruzoba urwiwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Ishikanwa ryose ry’ifu ryokejwe mw’ifuru canke rikaranzwe mw’isafuriya canke kw’ipano rizoba ari iryo umuherezi yaritanze, <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />kandi ishikanwa ryose ry’ifu, ryaba irivanze n’amavuta canke iritavanze, rizogabanganywa hagati y’abaherezi bakomoka kuri Aroni.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikimazi c’ishimwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />Ibi ni vyo vyagezwe vyerekeye ibimazi vy’ishimwe umuntu ashobora gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>:<verse eid="LEV 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />Niyatanga ikimazi c’ishimwe mu buryo bwo gukenguruka, aze aherekeshe ico kimazi co gukenguruka udukate tutarimwo umwambiro tuvanze n’amavuta, n’udukate twamijagiweko amavuta tutarimwo umwambiro, n’udutsima dukozwe mw’ifu twacumbwe mu mavuta. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />Ikimazi c’ishimwe co gukenguruka gitegerezwa kandi guherekezwa n’udukate turimwo umwambiro. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Aze ashikane kamwekamwe mu bwoko bwose nk’ingabire ihawe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; rizoba ari iryo umuherezi yamijagiye amaraso y’ivyo bimazi vy’ishimwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Inyama z’ico kimazi c’ishimwe co gukenguruka zize ziribwe kuri uwo musi catangiweko; ntihaze hagire izisigara ngo zishike mu gitondo c’uwundi musi.<verse eid="LEV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />Ariko ikimazi ciwe nicaba ari ico gushitsa isezerano canke ico atanze kuko avyishakiye, kize kiribwe ku musi gitangiweko, ariko izisigaye zishobora no kuribwa ku musi ukurikira. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Inyama zose z’ikimazi zizosigara gushika umusi ugira gatatu zize ziturirwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Nihagira inyama z’ikimazi c’ishimwe ziribwa ku musi ugira gatatu, uwagitanze ntazokwemerwa. Nta co kizomarira uwo muntu yagitanze, kuko kizoba gihumanye. Umuntu wese azorya kuri co azoba ari uwo gutsindwa n’urubanza.<verse eid="LEV 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />Inyama zikoze ku kintu cose gihumanye ntizize ziribwe; zize ziturirwe. Nk’uko biri no ku zindi nyama, umuntu wese adahumanye aze arye izo nyama. <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />Ariko nihagira umuntu ahumanye arya ku nyama z’ikimazi c’ishimwe c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uwo muntu aze acibwe mu bwoko bwiwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />Nihagira umuntu akora ku kintu na kimwe gihumanye; ari ibiva mu muntu bihumanya canke igikoko gihumanye canke ikindi kintu cose gihumanye gikwega inda hasi, hanyuma akarya ku nyama zo ku kimazi c’ishimwe c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uwo muntu aze acibwe mu bwoko bwiwe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirazira kurya ibinure n’amaraso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />“Barira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Ntimuze murye ikinure na kimwe caba ic’inka, ic’intama canke ic’impene. <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Ibinure vy’igikoko gipfuye ata wucishe canke catabaguwe n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba mushobora kubikoresha ibindi, ariko ntimuze mubirye. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />Umuntu wese azorya ibinure vyavuye mu kimazi co guturirwa gishikanirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze acibwe mu bwoko bwiwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" />Kandi aho muzoba muba hose, ntimuze murye amaraso y’inyoni canke igikoko na kimwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Nihagira umuntu arya amaraso, uwo muntu aze acibwe mu bwoko bwiwe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugabane w’umuherezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />“Barira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Uwuzoshikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikimazi c’ishimwe aze ashikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igice kimwe caco nk’ikimazi. <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />Aze akoreshe amaboko yiwe ubwiwe ashikane ikimazi co guturirwa, atange ibinure n’igikiriza, hanyuma azungagize ico gikiriza imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’ishikanwa ryo kuzungagiza. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Umuherezi aze aturirire ku gicaniro ivyo binure, ariko ico gikiriza ni ica Aroni n’abahungu biwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Muze muhe uwo umuherezi itako ry’i buryo ry’ibimazi vy’ishimwe ribe umugabane wiwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />Umuhungu wa Aroni azotanga amaraso n’ibinure vy’ikimazi c’ishimwe aze ahabwe itako ry’i buryo ribe umugabane wiwe. <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Ku bimazi vy’ishimwe vy’Abisirayeli, nahisemwo guha Aroni umuherezi n’abahungu biwe igikiriza co kuzungagiza n’itako ry’i buryo ngo bibe umugabane wabo w’intahava bazohabwa n’Abisirayeli.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Uyu ni wo mugabane wagenewe Aroni n’abahungu biwe uhereye igihe bazoba barobanuwe ngo bakorere <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’abaherezi. <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />Umusi basigwa amavuta, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse ko Abisirayeli babaha umugabane w’intahava uko urunganwe ruzokwama rukurikirana n’urundi.<verse eid="LEV 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Ibi ni vyo vyagezwe bigenga ibimazi vyo guturirwa, ibimazi vy’ifu, ibimazi vy’ivyaha, ibimazi vy’indishi, ikimazi co kurobanura n’ikimazi c’ishimwe, <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahaye Mose ku musozi Sinayi igihe yategeka Abisirayeli gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimazi vyabo, mu bugaragwa bw’i Sinayi.<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ukurobanurwa kwa Aroni n’abahungu biwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />“Zana Aroni n’abahungu biwe, imyambaro yabo, amavuta yo kurobanura, ishuri y’ikimazi c’ivyaha, impfizi z’intama zibiri hamwe n’igiseke kirimwo imikate itarimwo umwambiro, <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />hanyuma ukoranirize ishengero ryose imbere y’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro.” <verse eid="LEV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Nuko Mose akora nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamubariye, hanyuma ishengero ryose rikoranira ku muryango w’ihema ry’ibonaniro.<verse eid="LEV 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Mose abwira ikoraniro ati: “Ibi ni vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse ko bikorwa.” <verse eid="LEV 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Maze Mose azana Aroni n’abahungu biwe araboza n’amazi. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />Yambika Aroni wa mwambaro usharijwe n’amabara, amukenyeza n’umukanda, yongera amwambika wa mutamana uri kumwe na efodi, iyo efodi aca arayimukenyeza akoresheje igitambara co gushariza. <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Amwambika na ka gafuko ko mu gikiriza hanyuma agashiramwo Urimu na Tumimu. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Amwambika na ca gitambara mu mutwe agishirako ka gasharizo k’inzahabu kameze nk’ishurwe, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse Mose.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Mose aca yakira ya mavuta yo kurobanura, ayarobanuza rya hema n’ibiri muri ryo vyose. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Amijagira ayo mavuta ku gicaniro incuro indwi, akirobanurira hamwe n’ibindi bikoresho vyaco vyose, na ca gikarabiro n’amaguru yaco na vyo arabirobanura. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Asuka ya mavuta yo kurobanura ku mutwe wa Aroni, amurobanurira igikorwa yatoranirijwe. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Hanyuma azana abahungu ba Aroni, abambika ya myambaro isharijwe n’amabara, abakenyeza ya mikanda, abambika na vya bitambara mu mitwe, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabitegetse Mose.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Nuko azana ya shuri y’ikimazi c’ivyaha, Aroni n’abahungu biwe barambika ibiganza vyabo ku mutwe wayo. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Mose aca akerera iyo shuri, afata igice c’amaraso yayo ayasigisha urutoke ku mahembe y’igicaniro kugira ngo agihumanure, ayasigaye ayasuka i ruhande y’igicaniro. Uko ni ko yarobanuye ico gicaniro kugira ngo aceze. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Mose aca afata ibinure vyose bipfutse ivyo mu nda, igice gipfutse igitigu, amafyigo yompi n’ibinure biri kuri yo, abituririra ku gicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Ariko ibisigaye vy’iyo shuri, urusato n’inyama n’amayezi abituririra hirya y’aho bari bacumbitse, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabitegetse Mose.<verse eid="LEV 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Aca azana ya mpfizi y’intama y’ikimazi co guturirwa, Aroni n’abahungu biwe barambika ibiganza vyabo ku mutwe wayo. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Mose aca akerera iyo mpfizi y’intama amaraso yayo ayamijagira ku mpande zose z’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Aca afata ya mpfizi y’intama ayihimbaguramwo ibihimba, ivyo bihimba aca abituririra hamwe n’umutwe n’ibinure. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Amaze kwoza n’amazi ivyo mu nda n’amaguru, aca aturirira ya mpfizi y’intama yose ku gicaniro nk’ikimazi co guturirwa, ikimazi kimota neza, ishikanwa rishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rituriwe n’umuriro, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabitegetse Mose.<verse eid="LEV 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Hanyuma Mose aca azana ya mpfizi y’intama yindi, imwe yo kurobanura, Aroni n’abahungu biwe bayirambika ibiganza ku mutwe. <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Mose aca akerera iyo mpfizi y’intama asiga igice c’amaraso yayo ku gutwi kw’i buryo kwa Aroni, ku rukumu rw’ikiganza c’i buryo no kw’ino rikuru ry’ikirenge c’i buryo. <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Mose aca azana n’abahungu ba Aroni abasiga ya maraso ku matwi y’i buryo, ku nkumu no ku mano makuru vy’i buryo, hanyuma aca amijagira ayasigaye ku mpande zose z’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Aca afata ibinure vyo ku murizo, ibinure bipfutse ivyo mu nda, igice gipfutse igitigu, amafyigo yompi n’ibinure biri kuri yo n’itako ry’i buryo. <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Hejuru y’ivyo aca ashirako umukate utarimwo umwambiro, umukate ucumbanywe n’amavuta n’akandi gakate gatogato, ayikuye mu giseke c’imikate itarimwo umwambiro kiri imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />Vyose aca abishira mu biganza vya Aroni n’ivy’abahungu biwe, babishikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu kubizunguza nk’uko bigenda mu migenzo yo gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Hanyuma Mose abikura mu minwe yabo abituririra ku gicaniro hejuru y’ishikanwa rituririwe kurobanura, ishikanwa rimota neza, rishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rituriwe n’umuriro. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Mose afata igikiriza arakizunguza agishikiriza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ico ni co cari igice c’iyo ntama yo kurobanura yari agenewe, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarabimutegetse.<verse eid="LEV 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Hanyuma Mose yakira ku mavuta yo kurobanura no ku maraso ari ku gicaniro abimija Aroni n’imyambaro yiwe yongera abimija abahungu biwe n’imyambaro yabo.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Mose abarira Aroni n’abahungu biwe ati: “Nimuteke inyama zisigaye, muzitekere imbere y’umuryango w’ihema ry’ibonaniro, muzirire aho nyene muzikoze imikate iri muri ca giseke c’imikate y’amashikanwa yo kurobanura, nk’uko nategetse, aho navuga nti: ‘Aroni n’abahungu biwe baze babirye.’ <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Hanyuma ibisigara kuri izo nyama no kuri iyo mikate biturirwe. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Ntimuze muve ku muryango w’ihema ry’ibonaniro, muze muhamare imisi indwi, kuko kurobanurwa kwanyu kuzomara imisi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />Ivyo twakoze vyose uwu musi, ni vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse kugira ngo mutangirwe ikimazi c’ivyaha vyanyu. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Muze mugume ku muryango w’ihema ry’ibonaniro ku murango no mw’ijoro gushika imisi indwi iheze, mukore ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse kugira ngo ntimupfe, kuko uko ari ko nategetswe.”<verse eid="LEV 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Nuko Aroni n’abahungu biwe bakora vyose nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabibategetse abicishije kuri Mose.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s1">Abaherezi batangura igikorwa cabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Ku musi ugira umunani, Mose ahamagara Aroni n’abahungu biwe n’abakuru barongoye Abisirayeli. <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />Abarira Aroni ati: “Fata ishuri yo gutangwa nk’ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha vyawe, ufate n’impfizi y’intama itangwa nk’ikimazi co guturirwa, zose zibe izitagira agasembwa, uzizane imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" />Hanyuma ubarire Abisirayeli uti: ‘Mufate isuguru y’impene itangwa nk’ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha; inyana n’umwagazi w’intama, vyose bimaze umwaka umwe kandi zitagira agasembwa, vyo gutangwa nk’ikimazi giturirwa, <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />muzane n’ishuri, n’impfizi y’intama vyo gutangwa kw’ikimazi c’ishimwe gitangirwa imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, hamwe n’ishikanwa ry’ifu ivanze n’amavuta, kuko uwu musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agira abiyereke.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Maze baca bafata vya bintu vyose nk’uko Mose yabibategetse babizana imbere y’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro, kandi ikoraniro ryose riregera rihagarara imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Maze Mose arababwira ati: “Ibi ni vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabategetse gukora, kugira ngo ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bubone kubabonekera.”<verse eid="LEV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" />Mose abwira Aroni ati: “Niwegere igicaniro, utange ikimazi c’ivyaha vyawe hamwe n’ico guturirwa kugira ngo witangire ikimazi co kugucungura wewe n’ubwoko bwose; wongere utange ikimazi c’ihanga ryose kugira ngo ubatangire ikimazi co kubacungura, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse.”<verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Nuko Aroni yegera igicaniro akerera ya shuri y’ikimazi c’ivyaha vyiwe. <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Abahungu biwe bamuzanira amaraso, akozamwo urutoke rwiwe muri ayo maraso aca ayasiga ku mahembe y’igicaniro, ayasigaye ayasesa hasi hambavu y’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Aca aturirira ku gicaniro ibinure, amafyigo n’igice gipfutse igitigu vya ca kimazi c’ivyaha, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse Mose. <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Inyama n’urusato abituririra hirya y’aho bacumbitse.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Hanyuma aca akerera ca kimazi co guturirwa. Abahungu biwe bamuzanira amaraso, ayasesa hirya no hino y’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />Bamuhereza ca kimazi bagiciyemwo ibikenye, harimwo n’umutwe, abituririra ku gicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Hanyuma yoza ivyo mu nda n’amaguru abituririra ku gicaniro, hejuru ya ca kimazi caturiwe.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Nuko Aroni azana ca kimazi gitangirwa ihanga ryose. Afata ya mpene y’ikimazi c’ivyaha vyabo arayikerera ayitanga kw’ikimazi c’ivyaha nk’uko yari yabikoze kuri kimwe ca mbere c’ivyaha vyiwe.<verse eid="LEV 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Azana na ca kimazi co guturirwa agitanga nk’uko vyategetswe. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Aca azana na rya shikanwa ry’ifu, ayora ifu yuzuye urushi ayituririra ku gicaniro hamwe n’ikimazi co guturirwa co mu gitondo.<verse eid="LEV 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Akerera ya shuri na ya mpfizi y’intama vy’ikimazi c’ishimwe c’iryo hanga. Abahungu biwe bamuhereza amaraso, ayamijagira hirya no hino y’igicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Ariko imigabane y’ibinure vy’iyo shuri n’iyo mpfizi y’intama: umurizo, ibinure bipfutse ivyo mu nda, amafyigo n’igice gipfutse igitigu, <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />vyose abiremeka ku bikiriza vy’ivyo bitungwa bibiri, maze Aroni aturirira ivyo binure vyavyo ku gicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />Aroni azungagiza ivyo bikiriza n’amatako y’i buryo imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’ishikanwa ryo kuzungagiza, nk’uko Mose yabitegetse.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />Nuko Aroni aterura amaboko ayarabisha ku bantu bose arabahezagira. Amaze gutanga ikimazi c’ivyaha, ico guturirwa n’ic’amahoro, arururuka ava ku gicaniro.<verse eid="LEV 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Mose na Aroni baca binjira mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro. Bavuyeyo, bahezagira abantu bose, maze ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bubonekera abantu bose. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />Umuriro uva imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> utongora ca kimazi co guturirwa na ya migabane y’ibinure vyari ku gicaniro. Abantu bose babonye ivyo, barasemerera bavuza urwamo rw’umunezero baca bubama hasi.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Nadabu na Abihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Abahungu ba Aroni, Nadabu na Abihu, bakira ivyotezo vyabo, babishirako umuriro bashirako n’ibimota neza; baca bakoresha umuriro utemewe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ntibakurikiza uko yabitegetse. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Maze umuriro uvuye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> urarurumba urabatongora, bapfira rimwe aho nyene imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />Mose abwira Aroni ati: “Ibi ni vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yatubwira igihe yavuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LEV 10:3">‘Ku bantu begera aho ndi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LEV 10:3">nzokwiyerekana ndi Uwera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LEV 10:3">imbere y’amaso y’abantu bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LEV 10:3">nzokwihesha icubahiro.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LEV 10:3">Aroni araceceka.<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />Mose ahamagara Mishayeli na Elizafani, abahungu ba Uziyeli sewabo wa Aroni, arababwira ati: “Nimuze hano, mutware benewanyu inyuma y’aho abantu bacumbitse, mubigize kure y’ahera.” <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Baraza babaterura uko bakambaye ya myambaro yabo isharijwe n’amabara, babajana inyuma y’aho bacumbitse, nk’uko Mose yategetse.<verse eid="LEV 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />Maze Mose abwira Aroni n’abahungu biwe Eliyazeri na Itamari ati: “Ntimureke umushatsi wanyu udashokoje, kandi ntimwitabagurireko impuzu, kuko mwoca mupfa kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agashavurira ihanga ryose. Ariko incuti zanyu, ihanga ryose ry’Abisirayeli, baze bagandarire abo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaranduje umuriro. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Ntimuve imbere y’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro kugira ngo ntimupfe, kuko amavuta yo kurobanura y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kuri mwebwe.” Nuko bakora nk’uko Mose yavuze.<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />Hanyuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Aroni ati: <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />“Wewe n’abahungu bawe ntimuze mwigere munywa umuvinyu canke ikindi kinyobwa cose kirimwo umwambiro imbere y’uko muja mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro, kuko mwoca mupfa. Iki kize kibe icagezwe c’intahava uko urunganwe ruzokurakuranwa n’urundi, <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />kugira ngo muze mushobore gutandukanya ivyera n’ibisanzwe, ibihumanye n’ibidahumanye, <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />kandi muze mwigishe Abisirayeli amabwirizwa yose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabahaye abicishije kuri Mose.”<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />Mose abwira Aroni n’abahungu biwe basigaye ari bo Eliyazeri na Itamari ati: “Mwakire ishikanwa ry’ifu ryasigaye ku mashikanwa, mukore imikate muyizane imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, hanyuma muyirire i ruhande y’igicaniro, ariko ntibe irimwo umwambiro kuko ari iyera cane. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Muyirire ahantu hejejwe, kuko ari umugabane wanyu n’uw’abahungu banyu ku bimazi bishikanirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko ari ko nategetswe. <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />Ariko wewe n’abahungu n’abakobwa bawe mushobora kurya igikiriza cazungagijwe, hamwe n’itako, mukabirira ahantu hadahumanye. Bihawe wewe n’abana bawe nk’umugabane uvuye ku bimazi vy’ishimwe bitangwa n’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Itako n’igikiriza, bize bizanane n’imitigiri y’ibinure y’ibimazi vyo guturirwa, kugira ngo bizungagizwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’ishikanwa ryo kuzungagiza. Uwo uze ube umugabane wanyu w’intahava mwebwe n’abana banyu, nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse.”<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Maze Mose abajije ivyerekeye ya suguru y’impene y’ikimazi c’ivyaha vy’abantu bose, akamenya ko yaturiwe, aca ashavurira Eliyazeri na Itamari, abahungu ba Aroni bari basigaye, arababaza ati: <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />“Ni kuki mutaririye ico kimazi co gutangirwa ivyaha ahantu hera? Ni icera cane, mwari mwagihawe ngo gikureho icaha c’ihanga mu kubabera ikimazi c’ivyaha imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Kubera yuko amaraso yaco yari yajanywe Ahera, mwari kuba mwariye iyo mpene mukayirira mw’ihema, nk’uko nari nabitegetse.”<verse eid="LEV 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Aroni yishura Mose ati: “Uyu musi batanze ikimazi c’ivyaha vyabo n’ikimazi co guturirirwa imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ariko raba ivyambayeko. Mbega <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari guhimbarwa iyo mba nariye ku kimazi gitangirwa ivyaha vy’ihanga uwu musi?” <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Mose yumvise ivyo, aca yumva aranyuzwe.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ibizira n’ibitazira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose na Aroni ati: <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" />“Barira Abisirayeli muti: ‘Mu bikoko vyose biba mu gihugu, ibi ni vyo mwemerewe kurya: <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />mwemerewe kurya igikoko cose gifise ikinono gisatuye kandi cuza ivyo cariye.<verse eid="LEV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />Hariho bimwe vyuza gusa canke bifise ikinono gisatuye gusa: ivyo ntimuze mubirye. Ingamiya, naho yuza ntifise ikinono gisatuye; irahumanye kuri mwebwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Inkezi naho yuza, ntifise ikinono gisatuye; irahumanye kuri mwebwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Agakwavu naho kuza ntigafise ikinono gisatuye; karahumanye kuri mwebwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Ingurube naho ifise ibinono bisatuye, ntiyuza; na yo irahumanye kuri mwebwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Ntimuze murye inyama zavyo canke ngo mukore ku mivyimba yavyo; ivyo birahumanye kuri mwebwe.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />Mu biba mu mazi yo mu biyaga no mu nzuzi vyose, mwemerewe kurya ibifise amababa n’ibigaragamba. <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />Ariko ibiba mu mazi yo mu biyaga no mu nzuzi bitagira amababa n’ibigaragamba, vyaba ibigendera hamwe canke ibindi vyose biba mu mazi, muze mubigire umuziro. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Kandi ko ari ibizira kuri mwebwe, ntimuze mubirye kandi ntimuze mukore no ku mivyimba yavyo. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Ikintu cose kiri n’ubuzima kiba mu mazi ariko kidafise amababa n’ibigaragamba kirahumanye kuri mwebwe.<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />Ibi ni vyo muzofata nk’ibihumanye mu biguruka mu kirere kandi ntimuze mubirye kuko ari ibihumanye kuri mwebwe: inkona, ikinyakabaka, inkukuma, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />ikinyamwanira, icaruzanyoni nk’uko amoko yavyo ari, <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />ubwoko bwose bw’ibikona, <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />ikigendabunyovu, sarumfune, inguriguri, n’amoko yose y’ubuca; <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />igihuna, ikirovyi, inyanana, <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />ikinyamwanira, inkongori, ikiryamivyimba, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />agasoza, ubwoko bwose bw’inyange, samunsure, n’agahungarema.<verse eid="LEV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />Udukoko twose dufise amababa tukagendera ku maguru ane tuze tube uduhumanye kuri mwebwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />Ariko hariho udukoko tumwetumwe tuguruka tukagendera no ku maguru ane mushobora kurya: ni udufise amaguru afatanye n’ikirenge dushobora gusimbagurika kw’isi. <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Muri ivyo muze murye ubwoko bwose bw’inzige, ibihori canke intoteza. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Ariko udukoko twose tundi tuguruka dufise amaguru ane tuzoba duhumanye kuri mwebwe.<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />Umuntu wese azokora ku muvyimba w’utwo dukoko dutuma muhumana azoba ahumanye gushitsa ku mugoroba. <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Uwuzotwara umuvyimba watwo ategerezwa kumesa impuzu ziwe, azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba.<verse eid="LEV 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />Igikoko cose kidafise ikinono gisatuye canke kituza kirahumanye kuri mwebwe; kandi uwuzokora ku muvyimba wa kimwe muri vyo azoba ahumanye. <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Ibikoko vyose bifise amaguru ane ariko bitagira ibinono birahumanye kuri mwebwe. Uwuzokora ku muvyimba wa kimwe muri vyo azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba. <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />Uwuzokora ku muvyimba wa kimwe muri vyo ategerezwa kumesa impuzu ziwe, kandi azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba. Ivyo bikoko birahumanye kuri mwebwe.<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />Mu bikoko vyose bikwega inda hasi, ibi ni vyo bihumanye: ifuku, imbeba, ubwoko bwose bw’imiserebanyi, <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />icugu, ikivumbura, umuserebanyi mutoya, agacamano n’uruvuruvu. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Mu bikwega inda hasi vyose, ivyo ni vyo bizira kuri mwebwe. Umuntu azokora ku muvyimba wavyo azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Nihagira kimwe muri vyo gipfa kigakorokera ku kintu gikoreshwa, ico gikoresho, ico ari co cose, kizoba gihumanye, caba igikozwe mu giti, mu mpuzu, mu rusato canke mw’igunira, muze mugishire mu mazi; kize kigume gihumanye gushika ku mugoroba, hanyuma kizoba gihumanutse. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Nihagira igikorokera mu nkono y’ibumba, ibizoba biri muri yo vyose bizoba bihumanye, kandi muze mumene iyo nkono. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Ivyokurya vyose mwemerewe kurya bimaze gukorwako n’amazi yavuye muri iyo nkono bizoba bihumanye, kandi ibinyobwa vyose bizoba bivuye muri iyo nkono bizoba bihumanye. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Ikintu cose umuvyimba wavyo uzogwako kizoba gihumanye; iziko canke inkono iteka bize bimenagurwe. Bizoba bihumanye, kandi muze mubifate nk’ibihumanye. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Ariko niyaba ari isoko y’amazi canke ikinogo co kubikamwo amazi bizoguma ari ibidahumanye; ariko nihagira uwuzokora kuri uwo muvyimba azoba ahumanye. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Umuvyimba niwakorokera ku mbuto zo guterwa, zizoguma ari izidahumanye. <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />Ariko uwo muvyimba niwagwa ku mbuto zinitswe mu mazi, zizoba zihumanye kuri mwebwe.<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />Nihagira igikoko mu vyo mwemerewe kurya gipfa, umuntu wese azokora ku muvyimba waco azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />Umuntu wese azorya kuri uwo muvyimba aze amesure impuzu ziwe, kandi aze agume ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba. Uwuzoterura uwo muvyimba aze amesure impuzu ziwe, kandi aze agume ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba.<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />Igihumeka cose gikwega inda hasi kize gifatwe nk’igihumanye, ntikize kiribwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Ntimuze murye ikintu na kimwe gikwega inda hasi, caba igikwega inda hasi canke ikigendera ku maguru ane canke ayarenga; ni igihumanye. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Ntimuze mwihumanishe ivyo vyaremwe. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" />Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, muze mwiyeze mube abera, kuko nanje ndi uwera. Ntimuze mwiyandurishe na kimwe muri ivyo vyaremwe bikwega inda hasi. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nabakuye muri Egiputa ngo ndababere Imana; nuko rero mube abera, kuko nanje ndi uwera.<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />Ayo ni yo mategeko agenga ibikoko, inyoni, ikintu cose gihumeka kigendagenda mu mazi n’ikigendagenda kw’isi. <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />Muze mutandukanye ibizira n’ibitazira, ivyemewe kuribwa mu bihumeka n’ibitemewe kuribwa.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Guhumanurwa kw’umugore ahejeje kwibaruka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />“Barira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Umugore niyasama inda hanyuma akavyara umuhungu azoba ahumanye kumara imisi indwi, nk’uko aba ahumanye iyo yagiye mu miziro y’abagore. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" />Ku musi ugira umunani uwo muhungu aze akebwe agakoba gapfutse umutwe w’igitsina ciwe. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Hanyuma uwo mugore aze arindire imisi mirongo itatu n’itatu hanyuma aheze ahumanurwe kubera amaraso yavuye mu kwibaruka. Ntaze akore ku kintu na kimwe cejejwe canke ngo aje mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro iyo misi yo guhumanurwa kwiwe itarahera. <verse eid="LEV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />Niyavyara umukobwa, uwo mugore azomare amayinga abiri ahumanye, nk’uko biri mu gihe ari mu miziro y’abagore. Aze arindire imisi mirongo itandatu n’itandatu kugira ngo ahumanurwe kubera amaraso yavuye mu kwibaruka.<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />Iyo misi yo guhumanurwa niyahera, haba ku muhungu canke ku mukobwa, aze ashire umuherezi umwagazi w’intama umaze umwaka umwe, awumuhere imbere y’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro ube ikimazi co guturirwa, amuhane n’agaswi k’inuma isanzwe canke intunguru kugira ngo bibe ikimazi c’ivyaha. <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Uwo muherezi aze abishikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kugira ngo bibere ikimazi gicungura uwo mugore, na we azoba ahumanuwe kubera amaraso yavuye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 12:7">Ivyo ni vyo vyagezwe vyerekeye umugore yavyaye umuhungu canke umukobwa. <verse eid="LEV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" />Niyaba adashobora kuronka umwagazi w’intama, aze atange inyoni zitwa intunguru zibiri canke inuma zikiri nto zibiri, inyoni imwe izoba ikimazi co guturirwa, iyindi na yo ibe ikimazi c’ivyaha. Uko ni ko umuherezi azotangira impongano uwo mugore, na we azoba ahumanuwe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyagezwe vyerekeye ingwara zo ku rukoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Mose na Aroni ati: <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />“Umuntu niyaba afise ikibibi canke igisekera canke ikivyimba ku mubiri wiwe gishobora kuvamwo imibembe, baze bamushire Aroni canke umwe mu bana biwe azoba ari umuherezi. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Uwo muherezi aze asuzume ico kintu kiri ku mubiri, niyasanga ubwoya buri muri ico kibibi bwahindutse bukera kandi n’ico kibibi na co nyene cimburutse, izoba ari imibembe. Uwo muherezi amaze kumusuzuma aze amenyeshe ko uwo muntu acitse uwuhumanye. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Ico kibibi nicaba cera ariko kitimburutse kandi ubwoya buri muri co ntibwere, uwo muherezi aze ashire uwo muntu ahantu ha wenyene ahamare imisi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Ku musi ugira indwi uwo muherezi aze asubire amusuzume, niyasanga ico kibibi kitahindutse kandi kitagutse, aze asubire amushire ahantu ha wenyene iyindi misi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />Ku musi ugira indwi aze asubire kandi amusuzume. Ico kibibi nicaba cagabanutse nticiyongere ku mubiri, uwo muherezi aze amenyeshe ko uwo muntu adahumanye; kizoba ari ikibibi gisanzwe. Uwo muntu aze amesure impuzu ziwe, aheze abe ahumanuwe. <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Ariko ico kibibi niciyongera ku mubiri inyuma y’uko umuherezi azoba yamaze kumenyesha ko adahumanye, aze agaruke kubonana n’umuherezi. <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Uwo muherezi aze amusuzume, ico kibibi nicaba caragutse, aze amenyeshe ko ahumanye; izoba ari imibembe.<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />Umuntu wese azoba agwaye ingwara yo ku rukoba, baze bamushire umuherezi. <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />Umuherezi aze amusuzume, niyasanga ahari ikibibi hera kandi n’ubwoya bwo muri ico kibibi bwahindutse bukera hakaba hanavyimvye, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />izoba ari imibembe yamufashe. Umuherezi azoce amenyesha ko ahumanye. Ntaze arinde kumushira ahantu ha wenyene ngo amusuzume, kuko azoba yari asanzwe amaze guhumana.<verse eid="LEV 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />Iyo ngwara niyaba yakwiye umubiri wose, aho umuherezi agarukiriza amaso hose, kuva ku mutwe gushika ku birenge, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />uwo muherezi aze amusuzume, asanze iyo ngwara ikwiye umubiri wiwe wose, aze amenyeshe ko iyo ngwara idatuma umuntu aba uwuhumanye, hanyuma amenyeshe ko uwo muntu adahumanye. Kuko umubiri wiwe wose wahindutse ukera, azoba adahumanye. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Ariko igihe habonetse igisebe gishasha kuri we, azoba ahumanye. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Umuherezi niyabona ico gisebe gishasha, aze yihute kumenyesha ko ahumanye kuko igisebe kiba gihumanye; azoba agwaye imibembe. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Ico gisebe nicahinduka kikera, azoce aja ku muherezi. <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Uwo muherezi aze amusuzume, niyasanga ico gisebe cahindutse kikera, uwo muherezi azoce amenyesha ko adahumanye; azoba ahumanutse.<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />Umuntu niyagira igisebe ku mubiri kigakira, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />hanyuma ahari ico gisebe hakaboneka ikivyimba cera canke igishunduri cera canke gishaka gutukura, aze yiyereke umuherezi. <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Uwo muherezi aze ahasuzume, niyasanga himburutse kandi ubwoya bwaho bwahindutse bukera, uwo muherezi aze ace amenyesha ko uwo muntu ahumanye; izoba ari imibembe yadutse muri ya nkovu. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Ariko umuherezi niyahasuzuma agasanga ubwoya bwaho ntibwera kandi ntihimburutse kandi humye, uwo muherezi aze amushire ahantu ha wenyene imisi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Aho hantu nihakomeza kuba hanini, umuherezi aze amenyeshe ko uwo muntu ahumanye; izoba ari imibembe. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Ariko nihaba ata cahindutse kandi hatabandanije kuba hanini, izoba ari inkovu gusa ivuye ku gisebe, umuherezi aze amenyeshe ko uwo muntu adahumanye.<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />Umuntu niyagira ubushe ku mubiri wiwe maze hakaboneka ibara ryera canke ryera rishaka gusa n’agahama, <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />umuherezi aze ahasuzume, niyasanga ubwoya bwaho bwahindutse bukera, kandi himburutse, izoba ari imibembe izoba yafatiye muri ya nkovu y’ubushe. Uwo muherezi aze amenyeshe ko uwo muntu ahumanye; izoba ari imibembe. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Ariko niyamusuzuma agasanga ubwoya bwaho butera, hatimburutse kandi humye, uwo muherezi azoce amushira ahantu ha wenyene imisi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Ku musi ugira indwi umuherezi aze amusuzume. Niyasanga habandanije haba hanini, uwo muherezi azoce amenyesha ko uwo muntu ahumanye; izoba ari imibembe. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Ariko niyasanga ata cahindutse kandi hatabaye hanini ariko humye, izoba yari inkovu y’ubushe gusa, uwo muherezi aze amenyeshe ko uwo muntu adahumanye; izoba yari inkovu gusa y’ubushe.<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />Umugabo canke umugore niyafatwa n’igisekera mu mutwe canke ku gasakanwa, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />umuherezi aze asuzume ico gisekera, niyasanga carimburutse kandi ubwoya canke umushatsi uri muri co wahindutse ugasa n’umuhondo kandi ari mutomuto cane, uwo muherezi aze amenyeshe ko uwo muntu ahumanye; bizoba ari ibinyoro, bifatira mu mutwe canke ku gasakanwa. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Ariko uwo muherezi niyasuzuma ico gisekera, agasanga nticasebuye kandi ata mushatsi wirabura urimwo, uwo muherezi aze ashire uwo muntu ahantu ha wenyene imisi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Ku musi ugira indwi uwo muherezi aze asuzume ico gisekera, nicaba kitabandanije kiba kinini, ata bwoya bw’umuhondo buri muri co, <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />baze bamumwe ariko ahagwaye bahareke, hanyuma uwo muherezi amusubize ha hantu ha wenyene iyindi misi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Ku musi ugira indwi umuherezi aze asuzume ca gisekera, nicaba kitabandanije kiba kinini kandi kitimburutse, umuherezi aze amenyeshe ko uwo muntu adahumanye. Aze amesure impuzu ziwe, aho azoba yejejwe. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Ariko nicabandanya caguka umuherezi amaze kumenyesha ko yahumanutse, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />umuherezi aze amusuzume, asanze caragutse, uwo muherezi ntaze arinde kuraba ko umushatsi usa n’umuhondo; uwo muntu azoba ahumanye. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Ariko niyasuzuma agasanga nta cahindutse kandi haratanguye kumera umushatsi wirabura, ico gisekera kizoba kiriko kirakira. Azoba ahumanutse, kandi umuherezi aze amenyeshe ko uwo muntu adahumanye.<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />Umugabo canke umugore niyagira ibibara vyera ku mubiri, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />umuherezi aze abisuzume. Ivyo bibara nivyaba vyera buhorobuhoro, izoba ari ingwara isanzwe yo ku rukoba; uwo muntu ntazoba ahumanye.<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />Umugabo avungutse umushatsi akagira ubuhanza, ntazoba ahumanye. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Avungutse umushatsi w’imbere akagira ubuhanza imbere, ntazoba ahumanye. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Ariko muri ubwo buhanza hagati canke mu ruhanga nihaza igisebe cera kandi kigomba gutukura, izoba ari imibembe yamufashe ku mutwe canke mu ruhanga. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Umuherezi aze amusuzume, niyasanga ico gisebe cera kandi kigomba gutukura nk’imibembe, <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />uwo muntu azoba agwaye kandi azoba ahumanye. Uwo muherezi aze amenyeshe ko uwo muntu ahumanye kubera ico gisebe kiri ku mutwe.<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />Umuntu azoba afise imibembe nk’iyo aze yambare impuzu zitabaguritse, ntaze asokoze umushatsi wiwe, kandi aze yipfuke ku munwa agende arasemerera ati: ‘Ndahumanye! Ndahumanye!’ <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />Aze agume ahumanye igihe cose azoba akigwaye. Azobe ukwiwe, inyuma y’aho mucumbitse.<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyagezwe vyerekeye ivyaguye ifira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />Impuzu yose izojako ifira, yaba iyikozwe mu bwoya bw’intama canke iyijishwe mu nyuzi zera derere, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />yaba impuzu ijishwe mu bwoya bw’intama canke mu nyuzi zera, haba ku nsato canke ikintu cose gikozwe mu rusato, <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />iryo fira ribonetse ku mpuzu, ku rusato, ku mwambaro ujishwe, canke ku gikozwe mu rusato, niryaba risa n’urwatsi rubisi canke ritukura, rizoba ari ifira rikwiye gusuzumwa n’umuherezi. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Umuherezi aze asuzume iryo fira kandi ashire ico kintu ririko ukwa conyene imisi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Ku musi ugira indwi aze agisuzume, niyasanga iryo fira ryagwiriye kuri iyo mpuzu, canke uwo mwambaro canke ico gitambara, canke urwo rusato, ico ari co cose gikoreshwa, izoba ari ingwara y’imibembe; ico kintu kizoba gihumanye. <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Aze aturire iyo mpuzu, canke ico gitambara canke uwo mwambaro ujishwe mu bwoya bw’intama canke mu nyuzi zera, canke icakozwe mu rusato candukiwe n’iyo ngwara. Kubera ko iyo mibembe idashobora gukurwa muri ico kintu, kize giturirwe.<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />Ariko, umuherezi niyagisuzuma, agasanga rya fira ritabandanije rigwira kuri iyo mpuzu, ico gitambara canke uwo mwambaro, canke ico kintu gikozwe mu rusato, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />aze ategeke ko ico gikoresho kimesurwa. Hanyuma aze asubire agishire ahantu ha conyene iyindi misi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Ico gikoresho kimaze kumesurwa, umuherezi aze asubire agisuzume, niyasanga iryo fira ritahindutse uko ryari risanzwe risa, naho ritoba ryagwiriye, ico gikoresho kizoba gihumanye, muze mugiturire, naho uwo mubembe woba wafatiye ku ruhande rumwe canke urundi. <verse eid="LEV 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />Uwo muherezi niyagisuzuma, agasanga rya fira ryumye ico gikoresho kimaze kumesurwa, aze atabure ico gice c’iyo mpuzu canduye, canke c’urwo rusato, c’ico gitambara canke c’uwo mwambaro ujishwe. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Ariko niryasubira kuboneka kuri iyo mpuzu, kuri uwo mwambaro ujishwe, kuri ico gitambara canke ku cakozwe mu rusato, iryo fira rizoba ryagwiriye, bazoce baturira ico kintu kizoba gifise iryo fira ico ari co cose. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Iyo mpuzu, uwo mwambaro ujishwe, ico igitambara canke ico kintu gikozwe mu rusato cari camesuwe kigakurwako iryo fira, kize gisubire kimesurwe ubwa kabiri, kugira ngo kibe igihumanutse.<verse eid="LEV 13:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />Ivyo ni vyo vyagezwe bigenga ivyandukijwe n’ifira, vyaba ari impuzu zikozwe mu bwoya bw’intama canke mu nyuzi zera, ibitambara, imyambaro ijishwe canke ikintu cose gikozwe mu rusato, kugira ngo bimenyekane ko bihumanye canke bidahumanye.”<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Uguhumanurwa kw’umunyamibembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" />“Ibi ni vyo vyagezwe bigenga uguhumanurwa kw’umunyamibembe, igihe azoba aje imbere y’umuherezi: <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />Uwo muherezi aze aje inyuma y’aho bacumbitse aheze amusuzume. Uwo muntu niyaba yakize imibembe, <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />umuherezi aze avuge ko bamuzanira ivyo guhumanura uwo akwiye guhumanurwa: inyoni zibiri zidahumanye kandi zibona, igiti c’isederi, ubwoya bw’intama bwasizwe irangi ritukura n’ishami rya ezobu. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Hanyuma umuherezi aze ategeke ko bakererera imwe muri izo nyoni hejuru y’amazi meza ari mw’ibesani ikozwe mw’ibumba. <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />Hanyuma aze afate ya nyoni ikibona ayibize muri ya mazi arimwo ya maraso ya ya nyoni yakererwa, hamwe na ca giti c’isederi, na bwa bwoya bw’intama na ya ezobu. <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Aze amijagire ayo maraso incuro indwi kuri wa muntu akwiye guhumanurwa imibembe yiwe, ace yatura ko ahumanuwe. Aze aheze arekure ya nyoni ibona yigurukire mu kirere.<verse eid="LEV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />Uwo muntu ahumanuwe azoce amesa impuzu ziwe, yimoshe umushatsi wose kandi yoge umubiri wose; aho azoba ahumanutse. Ivyo biheze ashobora kugaruka aho mucumbitse, ariko aze agume hanze ntaze yinjire mw’ihema ryiwe imisi indwi idaheze. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Ku musi ugira indwi aze yimoshe umushatsi wose; aze akure umushatsi wo ku mutwe wiwe, ubwanwa bwiwe, ingohe zo ku maso yiwe, n’ubwoya aho buri hose ku mubiri, aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyoge umubiri wose, aho azoba ahumanutse.<verse eid="LEV 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />Ku musi ugira umunani aze ashikane imyagazi ibiri y’intama y’isuguru imaze umwaka, hamwe n’umwagazi w’intama uvyara umwe umaze umwaka, kandi yose izobe itagira agasembwa, ayishikane iri kumwe na bitatu vya cumi vy’ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 5.</char></note> y’ifu inoze neza ivanze n’amavuta bibe ikimazi c’ifu hamwe n’ingero logi imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’igice c’ilitiro.</char></note> y’amavuta. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Umuherezi ajejwe kumuhumanura aze ashire imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uwo muntu ahumanurwa hamwe n’amashikanwa yiwe imbere y’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro.<verse eid="LEV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />Umuherezi aze afate umwe muri iyo myagazi y’intama y’isuguru awutangeko ikimazi c’indishi, hamwe na ya ngero logi y’amavuta; aze abizungagize imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’ishikanwa ryo kuzungagiza. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />Aze akererere uwo mwagazi ahera aho basanzwe bakererera ibimazi vy’ivyaha n’ibimazi vyo guturirwa. Nk’uko bigenda ku kimazi c’ivyaha, ikimazi c’indishi ni ic’umuherezi; kandi ni icera cane. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Umuherezi aze afate amwe ku maraso y’ikimazi c’indishi ayasige ku gutwi kw’i buryo kw’uwo muntu akwiye guhumanurwa, ku rukumu rwo ku kiganza ciwe c’i buryo no kw’ino rikuru ry’ikirenge ciwe c’i buryo. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Hanyuma umuherezi aze yakire kuri ya ngero logi amavuta make ayasuke mu kiganza ciwe c’i bubamfu, <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />akozemwo urutoke rwiwe rukurikira urukumu rw’ikiganza ciwe c’i buryo, ace ayamijagira n’urwo rutoke incuro indwi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Umuherezi aze afate amavuta asigaye muri ca kiganza ciwe ayasige ku gutwi kw’i buryo kw’uwo muntu akwiye guhumanurwa, no ku rukumu rwiwe rw’i buryo no kw’ino rikuru ryiwe ry’i buryo, hejuru y’aho yasize ya maraso ya ca kimazi c’indishi. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Amavuta azosigara mu kiganza azoce ayasiga ku mutwe w’uwo muntu akwiye guhumanurwa, amutangire ikimazi co kumucungura imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />Inyuma y’ivyo, umuherezi aze atange ca kimazi c’ivyaha co gucungura uwo akwiye guhumanurwa, kugira ngo ntagume ahumanye. Umuherezi aze akerere ico kimazi co guturirwa, <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />ace agitanga ku gicaniro, hamwe na rya shikanwa ry’ifu, amutangire ikimazi kimucungura, na we azoba ahumanuwe.<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />Ariko niyaba ari umukene adashobora kuronka ivyo, azoshikane umwagazi w’intama umwe w’impfizi ube ikimazi c’indishi, ishikanwa ryo kuzungagiza kugira ngo ribe ikimazi co kumucungura. Azowushikane uri kumwe n’ic’icumi c’ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3,6.</char></note> y’ifu inoze neza ivanze n’amavuta nk’ishikanwa ry’ifu hamwe n’ingero logi imwe y’amavuta, <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />intunguru zibiri zikiri nto canke inuma, ivyo ashobora kuronka; kimwe kizoba ari ikimazi c’ivyaha, ikindi kizoba ari ikimazi co guturirwa.<verse eid="LEV 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />Ku musi ugira umunani, aze abishire umuherezi kugira ngo abone guhumanurwa, abimushikirize mu rwinjiriro rw’ihema ry’ibonaniro, imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Uwo muherezi aze yakire wa mwagazi w’intama w’ikimazi c’indishi na ya ngero logi y’amavuta, abizungagize imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’ishikanwa ryo kuzungagiza. <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />Aze akerere uwo mwagazi w’ikimazi c’indishi, ace afata amaraso yawo, amwe ayasige ku gutwi kw’i buryo kw’uwukwiye guhumanurwa, ku rukumu rwiwe rw’ikiganza c’i buryo no kw’ino rikuru ry’ikirenge c’i buryo. <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Uwo muherezi aze asuke ayo mavuta mu kiganza ciwe c’i bubamfu, <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />ace amijagira ayo maraso incuro indwi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’urutoke rwiwe rukurikira urukumu. <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Aze afate amavuta makeya kuri ayo ari mu kiganza c’i bubamfu ayashire hamwe yashira amaraso ya ca kimazi c’indishi: ku gutwi kw’i buryo, ku rutoke rw’urukumu rw’ikiganza c’i buryo no kw’ino rikuru ry’ikirenge c’i buryo. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Ayasigaye kuri ayo mavuta ari mu kiganza c’i bubamfu uwo muherezi aze ayasige ku mutwe wa wa muntu akwiye guhumanurwa, kugira ngo amutangire ikimazi co kumucungura imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Inyuma y’ivyo aze ashikane twa duswi tw’inuma canke tw’intunguru, ivyo uwo muntu ashoboye kuronka, <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />kamwe agatange nk’ikimazi c’ivyaha akandi agatange nk’ikimazi co guturirwa, hamwe na rya shikanwa ry’ifu. Uko ni ko uwo muherezi azotanga ishikanwa ryo kwicungura imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, aritangiye uwo akwiye guhumanurwa.”<verse eid="LEV 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />Ivyo ni vyo vyagezwe bigenga umuntu wese azoba yagwaye imibembe ariko akaba adashobora kuronka vya bimazi vyategetswe kugira ngo ashobore guhumanurwa.<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Guhumanurwa kw’uwandujwe n’ifira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose na Aroni ati: <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />“Nimwashika i Kanani, igihugu ngiye kubaha ngo kibe icanyu, ngateza ifira mu nzu kanaka muri ico gihugu, <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />nyene iyo nzu aze agende abimenyeshe umuherezi ati: ‘Nabonye igisa n’ifira mu nzu yanje.’ <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Uwo muherezi aze asabe bakuremwo ibintu isigare igaragara imbere y’uko aja gusuzuma iryo fira, kugira ngo ntihagire na kimwe co muri iyo nzu kivugwa ko gihumanye. Hanyuma y’ivyo, umuherezi aze agende agendure iyo nzu. <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />Aze asuzume iryo fira ku mpome, niyasanga iryo fira rifise utunogonogo dusa n’urwatsi rubisi canke dutukura kandi dusa n’utwimburutse mu ruhome, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />uwo muherezi aze asohoke aciye mu muryango w’iyo nzu, ace yugara iyo nzu imisi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />Ku musi ugira indwi, uwo muherezi aze agaruke gusuzuma iyo nzu. Niyasanga iryo fira ryatandukiriye ahandi ku mpome, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />aze ategeke bakureho amabuye yafashwe n’iryo fira, bace bayata mu kibanza gihumanye inyuma y’igisagara. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Aze asabe baharagure impome zose ku ruhande rw’imbere bace bata ivyo bivunguka mu kibanza gihumanye inyuma y’igisagara. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Hanyuma baze barondere ayandi mabuye yo gusubiriza ya yandi n’ivyo guhoma bishasha bisubirira ivyaharaguwe.<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />Iryo fira niryasubira kuboneka muri iyo nzu kandi bakuyeho amabuye n’ivyari bihomye kuri yo bakabisubiriza n’ibindi, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />uwo muherezi aze asubire agende ayisuzume. Niyasanga iryo fira ryagwiriye mu nzu, izoba ari imibembe; iyo nzu izoba ihumanye. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Iyo nzu ize isamburwe. Amabuye yayo, imbaho zayo n’ivyo bakoresheje mu kuyihoma, bize bisamburwe bitabwe inyuma y’igisagara ahantu hahumanye.<verse eid="LEV 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />Umuntu wese azokwinjira iyo nzu mu gihe izoba yugawe azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Umuntu wese azorira canke akarara muri iyo nzu aze amesure impuzu ziwe.<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />Ariko wa muherezi niyaza kuyisuzuma agasanga iryo fira ritabandanije rigwira bamaze kuyisiga bushasha, aze avuge ko iyo nzu idahumanye, kuko iryo fira rizoba ryaheze. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Mu guhumanura iyo nzu aze azane inyoni zibiri n’igiti c’isederi, n’ubwoya bw’intama busize irangi ritukura, hamwe na ezobu. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />Aze akererere imwe muri izo nyoni hejuru y’ibesani ikozwe mw’ibumba irimwo amazi meza. <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />Hanyuma aze afate ca giti c’isederi, ya ezobu na bwa bwoya bw’intama busize irangi ritukura, na ya nyoni ibona, avyibize muri ya maraso ya ya nyoni yakererwa avanze na ya mazi meza, hanyuma amijagire iyo nzu incuro indwi. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Aze ahumanuze iyo nzu amaraso ya ya nyoni, ya mazi meza, ya nyoni ibona, ca giti c’isederi, ezobu na bwa bwoya bw’intama busizwe irangi ritukura. <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />Aze aheze arekure ya nyoni ibona yigurukire inyuma y’igisagara. Uko ni ko azotanga ikimazi co gucungura iyo nzu, na yo izoba ihumanuwe.”<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />Ivyo ni vyo vyagezwe bigenga ubwoko bwose bw’imibembe, ibinyoro, <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />ifira mu mpuzu canke mu nzu, <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />ibihute, ibisekera n’ibibara, <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />kugira ngo vyerekane ko ikintu gihumanye canke kidahumanye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 14:57">Ivyo ni vyo vyagezwe bigenga ingwara zo ku rukoba no mu mpuzu.<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ibihumanya biva mu muntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose na Aroni ati: <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />“Bwira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Umugabo niyafatwa n’ingwara yo mu bihimba vy’irondoka, ibimuvamwo vyose bizoba bihumanye. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />Igihe cose bizoba bikiza biva mu mubiri wiwe canke vyazibiwe, uwo muntu azoba ahumanye. Uku ni ko ivyo bimuvamwo bizotuma umuntu ahumana:<verse eid="LEV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />Uburiri bwose uwo muntu azoryamako buzoba buhumanye, n’ikintu cose azokwicarako kizoba gihumanye. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Umuntu wese azokora kuri ubwo buriri aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi, kandi aze agume ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba. <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Umuntu wese azokwicara ku kintu na kimwe uwo muntu yicayeko aze amesure impuzu ziwe kandi yiyuhagire n’amazi, kandi aze agume ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba.<verse eid="LEV 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />Umuntu wese azokora kuri uwo muntu aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi, kandi aze agume ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba.<verse eid="LEV 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />Uwo muntu agwaye niyacira ku muntu yari asanzwe adahumanye, uwo yaciriyeko aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi, kandi aze agume ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba.<verse eid="LEV 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />Ikintu cose uwo muntu agwaye azokwicarako ari kw’ifarasi kizoba gihumanye, <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />kandi umuntu wese azokora kuri ivyo bintu vyose vyari musi yiwe azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba; uwuzoterura ikintu na kimwe muri ivyo aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi, kandi aze agume ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba.<verse eid="LEV 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />Umuntu wese uwo mugwayi azokorako adakaravye n’amazi aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi, kandi aze agume ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba.<verse eid="LEV 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />Inkono y’ibumba yose uwo mugwayi azokorako ize imenagurwe, kandi nicaba ari igikoresho gikozwe mu giti ico ari co cose kize cozwe n’amazi.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />Umuntu niyakira iyo ngwara yamutera ubuhumane, aze aharure imisi indwi imbere yo guhumanurwa. Niyahera aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi meza, azoba ahumanuwe. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Ku musi ugira umunani aze atware intunguru zibiri zikiri nto canke inuma zikiri nto azishikane imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu bwinjiriro bw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro abihe umuherezi. <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Umuherezi aze abitangeko ibimazi, kimwe kibe ikimazi c’ivyaha, ikindi kibe ikimazi co guturirwa. Azoba atangiye uwo muntu ikimazi co kwicungura imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kubera ivyamuvuyemwo.<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />Umugabo niyasesa imbuto ziwe mw’ijoro, aze yiyuhagire umubiri wose n’amazi, aze agume ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Impuzu yose canke ikintu cose gikozwe mu rusato izo mbuto zashitseko kize kimesurwe n’amazi, kandi kizoba gihumanye gushika ku mugoroba. <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />Umugabo niyaryamana n’umugore hakaba gusohora imbuto, baze biyuhagire n’amazi, kandi bazoba bahumanye gushika ku mugoroba.<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />Umugore niyaja mu miziro yiwe, azoba ahumanye imisi indwi, kandi umuntu wese azomukorako azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba.<verse eid="LEV 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />Ico azoryamako cose akiri mu miziro yiwe kizoba gihumanye, kandi ico azokwicarako cose kizoba gihumanye. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Uwuzokora ku buriri yaryamyeko aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi, kandi azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba. <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />Umuntu wese azokora ku kintu na kimwe uwo mugore yicayeko aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi, kandi azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba. <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />Bwaba uburiri canke ikintu cose yicayeko, nihagira umuntu agikorako, azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba.<verse eid="LEV 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />Nihagira umugabo aryamana n’uwo mugore maze amaraso amuvamwo ku bw’iyo miziro yiwe agakora kuri uwo mugabo, azoba ahumanye imisi ndwi, mbere n’uburiri bwose azoryamako buzoba buhumanye.<verse eid="LEV 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />Umugore niyaguma ava amaraso imisi myinshi mu gihe ciwe c’imiziro, canke niyaba aguma ava amaraso kurenza ukwezi kwiwe, azoguma ahumanye imisi yose bizomara, nk’uko bigenda igihe ari mu kwezi kwiwe. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Uburiri bwose azoryamako igihe azoba ari muri ivyo bihe buzoba buhumanye, ni co kimwe n’uburiri bwiwe aryamako mu gihe c’ukwezi kwiwe, kandi ikintu cose azokwicarako kizoba gihumanye, nk’uko bimeze mu gihe c’ukwezi kwiwe gusanzwe. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Kandi umuntu wese azobikorako azoba ahumanye. Aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi, kandi azoguma ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba.<verse eid="LEV 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />Kuva amaraso nivyahagarara, aze aharure imisi ndwi, niyahera azoba ahumanutse. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Ku musi ugira umunani aze azane intunguru zibiri zikiri nto, inuma zibiri zikiri nto azizanire umuherezi imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Uwo muherezi aze abitange, kimwe kibe ikimazi c’ivyaha, ikindi kibe ikimazi co guturirwa. Aho ni ho azoba amutangiye ikimazi co kumucungura imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kubera ubuhumane yatewe n’ayo maraso.<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />Muze murinde Abisirayeli ibintu vyose vyobahumanya, kugira ngo ntibapfe bazize ubwo buhumane kuko bohava bahumanya inzu yanje yera iri hagati muri bo.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />Ivyo ni vyo vyagezwe bigenga ibiva mu bihimba vy’irondoka, yaba umugabo yahumanijwe n’uko yasohoye imbuto ziwe, <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />yaba umugore ari mu kwezi kwiwe, yaba umugabo canke umugore bagwaye mu bihimba vy’irondoka, bigatuma bava ibintu bibahumanya, canke umugabo yaryamanye n’umugore asanzwe ahumanye.<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Umusi w’inzamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaravuganye na Mose inyuma y’urupfu rwa ba bahungu babiri ba Aroni bapfuye igihe begera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bafise umuriro utari wo imbere yiwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: “Bwira mukuru wawe Aroni ntaze yinjire uko yishakiye Ahera Cane inyuma ya ca gihuzu gikingiriye imbere ya wa mupfundikizo batangirako ibimazi vyo kwicungura uri kw’Isandugu y’Isezerano, kugira ngo ntapfe; kuko nzobonekera mu gicu hejuru ya wa mupfundikizo utangirwako ikimazi co gucungura.<verse eid="LEV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />Uku ni ko Aroni azokwinjira Ahera Cane: azoshikane ishuri kw’ikimazi c’ivyaha n’impfizi y’intama kw’ikimazi co guturirwa. <verse eid="LEV 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />Aze yambare umwambaro wiwe wera ujishe mu nyuzi zera derere, hamwe n’ibutura rijishe muri izo nyuzi nyene ngo ahishe ubwambure bwiwe; aze akenyeze wa mukanda wo mu nyuzi zera derere, yambare na ca gitambara cera derere. Izo ni impuzu zera; ni co gituma azobanza kwiyuhagira n’amazi imbere y’uko azambara. <verse eid="LEV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />Aze ashikane n’isuguru z’impene zivuye mu Bisirayeli kw’ikimazi c’ivyaha n’impfizi y’intama kw’ikimazi co guturirwa.<verse eid="LEV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />Aroni aze atange iyo shuri kw’ikimazi c’ivyaha vyiwe kugira ngo yitangire ishikanwa we n’umuryango wiwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Hanyuma aze afate za suguru z’impene azizane imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku muryango w’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro. <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Aze akoreshe ubupfindo kuri izo mpene kugira ngo amenye iyegukira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> n’iyo gutabwa mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Aroni aze afate iyo ubupfindo bweguriye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ayitange kw’ikimazi c’ivyaha. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Ariko iyerekanywe ko ari iyo gutabwa mu bugaragwa izozanwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikiri nzima kugira ngo ikoreshwe nk’ikimazi co gucungura bazorungika mu bugaragwa nk’impene yo gutabwa.<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />Aroni aze ashikane ya shuri kw’ikimazi ciwe c’ivyaha kugira ngo yitangire ikimazi ku gatwe kiwe n’abiwe, aheze ayikerere ibe ikimazi c’ivyaha vyiwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />Aze yakire ico kwokoza amakara yaka avuye ku gicaniro imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ayore amashi abiri y’ifu inoze y’ibimota neza kandi ikaranze, hamwe n’ibimota neza ace avyinjirana inyuma ya ca gihuzu gikinze. <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />Aze ashire ivyo bimota neza kuri wa muriro imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, hanyuma umwotsi uvuye muri ivyo bimota neza uzotwikira wa mupfundikizo utangirwako ikimazi co gucungura uri kw’Isandugu y’Isezerano, na we ntazoheza ngo apfe. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Aze ajane no ku maraso y’iyo shuri ace ayamijagira n’urutoke kuri wa mupfundikizo ku ruhande ruhera mu buseruko; aze ayamijagire kandi n’urutoke nyene incuro indwi imbere y’uwo mupfundikizo utangirwako ikimazi co gucungura.<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />Hanyuma azoce akerera ya mpene y’ikimazi c’ivyaha c’abantu, atware amaraso yayo inyuma ya ca gihuzu gikingiriye ayakoreshe nk’uko yakoze kuri ya yandi ya ya shuri: Azoyamijagire ku mupfundikizo utangirwako ikimazi co gucungura n’imbere yawo. <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />Ni muri ubwo buryo azotangira Ahera Cane ikimazi co gucungura kubera ubuhumane n’ubugarariji bw’Abisirayeli, uko ivyaha vyabo vyongana kwose. Aze agire atyo no ku bw’ihema ry’ibonaniro, kuko riri hagati muri bo, hagati mu buhumane bwabo. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Ntihaze hagire umuntu n’umwe yinjira mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro kuva igihe Aroni azoba yinjiye Ahera Cane gushika asohotse, amaze kwitangira impongano yiwe, iy’abo mu nzu yiwe hamwe n’iy’Abisirayeli bose.<verse eid="LEV 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />Hanyuma aze asohoke aje ku gicaniro kiri imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agitangire ikimazi na co nyene. Aze afate ku maraso ya ya shuri no ku ya ya suguru y’impene ayasige ku mahembe y’ico gicaniro. <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Aze amijagire ayo maraso kuri co n’urutoke rwiwe incuro indwi kugira ngo agihumanure yongere aceze ubuhumane bwose bw’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />Maze Aroni niyaheza gutangira impongano Ahera Cane, n’ihema ry’ibonaniro hamwe n’igicaniro, aze azane ya mpene ikibona. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Aze ayirambikeko ibiganza vyiwe vyompi ku mutwe yaturire kuri yo ukugabitanya n’ubugarariji bw’Abisirayeli, ivyaha vyabo vyose, abiremeke ku mutwe w’iyo mpene. Ahejeje azoce ayirungika mu bugaragwa ijanwe n’umuntu yatoranirijwe gukora ico gikorwa. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Iyo mpene izokwiremeka ivyaha vyabo vyose ibitware ahantu hatagira abantu; uwo muntu aze aheze ayirekurire mu bugaragwa.<verse eid="LEV 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />Aroni azoce asubira yinjire mw’ihema ry’ibonaniro akure za mpuzu zera derere yambara imbere y’uko yinjira Ahera Cane, azisigeyo, <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />hanyuma yiyuhagirire n’amazi ahantu hera ace yambara impuzu ziwe zisanzwe. Azoce asohoka atange ca kimazi co guturirwa ciwe na ca kimazi co guturirwa c’abantu bose, kugira ngo yitangire ikimazi we ubwiwe hamwe n’abantu bose. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Azoce aturirira ku gicaniro ibinure vyavuye kuri ca kimazi c’ivyaha.<verse eid="LEV 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />Wa muntu yatwara ya mpene yo gutabwa mu bugaragwa agarutse aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi; hanyuma ashobore kuja aho mucumbitse. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" />Ya shuri na ya suguru zatangwa nk’ibimazi vy’ivyaha, amaraso yavyo akajanwa Ahera Cane kugira ngo atangweko ikimazi co gucungura, bize bijanwe inyuma y’aho mucumbitse maze insato zavyo, inyama zavyo n’ivyo mu nda bize biturirwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Umuntu azobiturira aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi, abone kugaruka aho mucumbitse.<verse eid="LEV 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />Iri rize ribe ibwirizwa rihoraho kuri mwebwe: ku musi ugira icumi w’ukwezi kw’indwi muze mwisonzeshe kandi ntihagire igikorwa na kimwe mukora, yaba uwavukiye muri mwebwe canke umunyamahanga aba muri mwebwe, <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />kuko kuri uwo musi hazoba gucungurwa kwanyu, kugira ngo muhumanurwe. Namwe muzoba mwejejwe ivyaha vyanyu vyose. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Izoba ari Isabato y’ukuruhuka, muze muwuruhukeko kandi mwisonzeshe; iri rize ribe ibwirizwa rihoraho. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Umuherezi yasizwe amavuta kandi yatoranirijwe gusubirira se wiwe nk’umuherezi mukuru ni we azotanga ikimazi co gucungura. Aze yambare za mpuzu zera derere, <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />atange ikimazi co gucungura Ahera Cane, ihema ry’ibonaniro, igicaniro, abaherezi n’abantu bose.<verse eid="LEV 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />Iri rize ribe ibwirizwa rihoraho kuri mwebwe: ico kimazi co gucungura kizohora gitangwa rimwe mu mwaka gitangirwe ivyaha vyose vy’Abisirayeli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 16:34">Nuko baca bakora nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse Mose.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyagezwe bigenga amaraso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />“Vugana na Aroni n’abahungu biwe n’Abisirayeli bose ubabwire uti: ‘Ibi ni vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yategetse: <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />Umwisirayeli wese azotangira ikimazi c’ishuri, umwagazi w’intama canke w’impene aho mucumbitse canke inyuma yaho, <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" />aho kukizana ku muryango w’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro ngo agitange nk’ikimazi gishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> imbere y’Ihema ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uwo muntu azokwagirwa n’icaha co gusesa amaraso; azoba yasheshe amaraso kandi azoce acibwa mu muryango wiwe. <verse eid="LEV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />Iki cagezwe gitegeka Abisirayeli guhora bazanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimazi bahora batangira aho ari ho hose. Baze babizanire umuherezi, ni ko kubishikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro babitange nk’ibimazi vy’ishimwe. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Umuherezi aze amijagire amaraso ku gicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro, bace baturira ibinure nk’umubabwe umota neza uhimbara <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />Ntibaze basubire gutanga ibimazi vyabo babishikanira imana z’impene izo bihumanishije mu kwifatanya na zo. Iri rize ribe itegeko ry’intahava kuri bo uko urunganwe ruzokurakuranwa n’urundi.’<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />Nuko ubabwire uti: ‘Umwisirayeli wese canke umunyamahanga aba muri bo azotanga ishikanwa rituriwe canke ikimazi <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />atakizanye imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro ngo agishikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uwo muntu aze acibwe mu bwoko bwiwe.<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />Umwisirayeli wese canke umunyamahanga aba muri bo azorya amaraso, igitsure canje kizoba kuri uwo muntu arya amaraso kandi nzomukura mu bantu banje. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Kuko ubuzima bw’icaremwe buri mu maraso yaco, kandi nayabahaye kugira ngo ababere ikimazi co ku gicaniro co kubacungura; amaraso ni yo aba ikimazi c’ubuzima bw’umuntu. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Ni co gituma mbwiye Abisirayeli nti: “Ntihaze hagire umuntu n’umwe wo muri mwebwe canke umunyamahanga aba muri mwebwe azorya amaraso.”<verse eid="LEV 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />Umwisirayeli wese canke umunyamahanga aba muri mwebwe azohiga igikoko ico ari co cose canke inyoni ishobora kuribwa aze asese amaraso yose hanyuma ayarenzeko ivu, <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />kuko ubuzima bw’icaremwe cose ari amaraso yaco. Ni co gituma mbwiye Abisirayeli nti: “Ntimuze murye amaraso y’icaremwe na kimwe, kuko ubuzima bw’icaremwe cose ari amaraso yaco. Uwuzoyarya wese aze akurwe mu bantu.”<verse eid="LEV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" />Umuntu, yaba imvukira canke umunyamahanga, azorya ikintu yasanze capfuye canke catabaguwe n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba, aze amesure impuzu ziwe yiyuhagire n’amazi, ashishikare kuba uwuhumanye gushika ku mugoroba; aheze abe ahumanuwe. <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Ariko natamesura impuzu ziwe ngo yiyuhagira n’amazi, azobiharurwako nk’ukugabitanya.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ibizira ku babirana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />“Vugana n’Abisirayeli ubabwire uti: ‘Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Ntimuze mukore nk’uko mwahora mukora muri Egiputa, aho mwahora muba, kandi ntimuze mukore nk’uko bakora mu gihugu c’i Kanani, aho ngiye kubinjiza. Ntimuze mwigane ivyo bakora. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Muze mwumvire ivyagezwe vyanje, mwitondere ivyo ndabategetse. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" />Muze mwitondere ivyo nashinze n’ivyagezwe vyanje, kuko umuntu wese azovyitondera azobeshwaho na vyo. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />Ntihaze hagire umuntu yegera incuti yiwe ya hafi ngo barangurane amabanga mpuzabitsina. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />Ntuze umaramaze so mu kuryamana na nyoko. Ni umuvyeyi wawe; ntuze uryamane na we.<verse eid="LEV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" />Ntuze uryamane n’umugore wa so; kuko ni ukumaramaza so.<verse eid="LEV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />Ntuze uryamane na mushikawe, yaba uwo musangiye so gusa canke uwo musangiye nyoko gusa, yaba ari uwavukiye muri iyo nzu canke uwavukiye ahandi.<verse eid="LEV 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />Ntuze uryamane n’umwuzukuru wawe, yaba uwo ku muhungu canke uwo ku mukobwa; ivyo ni ibiterasoni.<verse eid="LEV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />Ntuze uryamane n’umukobwa w’umugore wa so, uwo so yavyaranye na we; kuko ni mushikawe.<verse eid="LEV 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />Ntuze uryamane na mushiki wa so, kuko ari incuti ya so ya hafi.<verse eid="LEV 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />Ntuze uryamane n’umuvukanyi wa nyoko, kuko ari incuti ya nyoko ya hafi.<verse eid="LEV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />Ntuze umaramaze sowanyu mu kuryamana n’umugore wiwe; kuko ari nyogosenge kuri wewe.<verse eid="LEV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" />Ntuze uryamane n’umukazana wawe, kuko ari umugore w’umuhungu wawe; ntuze uryamane na we.<verse eid="LEV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" />Ntuze uryamane na muramwawe; kuko kwoba ari ukumaramaza umuvukanyi wawe.<verse eid="LEV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />Ntuze uryamane n’umugore ngo wongere uryamane n’umukobwa wiwe. Kandi, ntuze uryamane n’umwuzukuru wiwe wo ku muhungu canke wo ku mukobwa; kuko ari incuti ziwe za hafi. Ico ni ikizira.<verse eid="LEV 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />Ntuze uharike umugore wawe, umuharikishije uwo bavukana, ngo uryamane na we umugore wawe akiriho.<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />Ntuze uryamane n’umugore ari mu miziro yiwe.<verse eid="LEV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" />Ntuze uryamane n’umugore wa mugenzawe ngo umwihumanishe.<verse eid="LEV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" />Ntuze utange umwana wawe ngo atangwe kw’ikimazi c’ikigirwamana Moleki, kuko ukwiye kwirinda ngo ntukengere izina ry’Imana yawe. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />Ntuze uryamane n’umugabo nk’uko baryamana n’umugore. Ico ni ikintu co kwankwa urunuka.<verse eid="LEV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />Ntuze uryamane n’igikoko ngo uciyandurishe. Ntihaze hagire umugore yitega igikoko ngo kiryamane na we; ni ubuhumane butavugwa.<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />Ntimuze mwiyanduze mu buryo na bumwe muri ubwo bwose, kuko uko ari ko amahanga ngiye gusohora mu gihugu ngiye kubinjiza biyanduje. <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" />Igihugu ubwaco caranduye; ni co gituma nagihanye kubera icaha caco, hanyuma na co gica kidahwa abakibamwo bose. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Ariko mwebwe muze mwitondere ivyo nabategetse vyose n’ivyo nashinze. Yaba imvukira canke umunyamahanga aba muri mwebwe, ntimuze mukore ibintu nk’ivyo vyo kwankwa urunuka, <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />kuko ivyo vyose vyakorwa n’amahanga yaba muri ico gihugu imbere yanyu, bituma ico gihugu gihumana. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />Nimwahumanya ico gihugu, kizobadahwa nk’uko cadashwe amahanga yariho imbere yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />Umuntu wese azokora na kimwe muri ivyo bintu vyo kwankwa urunuka aze akurwe mw’ihanga ryiwe. <verse eid="LEV 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />Muze mwitondere ivyo ndabasaba ntimuze mukurikire ingeso mbi n’ivyo bakora imbere y’uko muza, kugira ngo ntimwihumanishe izo ngeso. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyagezwe bitandukanye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" />“Vugana n’ishengero ryose ry’Abisirayeli ubabwire uti: ‘Mube abera kuko jewe, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, ndi uwera.<verse eid="LEV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" />Umuntu wese aze yubahe se na nyina, kandi aze yubahirize amasabato yanje. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" />Ntimuze muhindukirire ibigirwamana canke ngo mwikorere ibigirwamana mu butare buvugutiwe mu muriro. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />Nimwashikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikimazi c’ishimwe, muze mugitange neza ku buryo butuma mwemerwa. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Kize kiribwe ku musi mwagitangiyeko canke ku musi ukurikira; ibizoba bisigaye vyose gushika ku musi wa gatatu bize biturirwe. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />Nihagira ikintu na kimwe kiribwa ku musi wa gatatu, kizoba gihumanye kandi ntikizokwemerwa. <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />Umuntu wese azokiryako azotsindwa n’urubanza rw’uko yahumanije ivyera vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; uwo muntu aze acibwe mu bwoko bwiwe.<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />Nimwimbura ibivuye mu ndimiro zanyu, ntimuze mutware ivyamereye inyuma y’urubibe rwanyu canke ngo musubire inyuma gutora ivyo mwibagiriye mu mirima. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Ntimuze musubire mu ruzabibu rwanyu ubugira kabiri canke ngo mutore imbuto z’imizabibu zakorokeye hasi. Muze mubisigarize umukene n’inyambukira. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />Ntimukibe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:11">Ntimukabeshe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:11">Ntimugahendane.<verse eid="LEV 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />Ntimuze murahire ibinyoma, kugira ngo mwoye guhumanya izina ryanje; ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />Ntuze urenganye canke ngo wibe muganzawe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:13">Ntuze urare udahemvye umukozi wakoresheje.<verse eid="LEV 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" />Ntuze uvume igipfamatwi canke ngo ushire igitsitaza imbere y’impumyi: wubahe Imana yawe. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />Ntimuze muce imanza zigoramye mu guhengamira ku muntu ngo ni uko ari umugorwa canke ari umukuru, ahubwo mucire bagenzi banyu imanza z’ukuri.<verse eid="LEV 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />Ntimuze mugende muravuga nabi bagenzi banyu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:16">Ntimuze mukore ikintu gishobora gushira mu kaga k’urupfu bagenzi banyu. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />Ntuze ugirire urwanko mu mutima wawe abo mu bwoko bwanyu. Ariko uze wihanize mugenzawe ariko arakora ikibi kugira ngo ntuhave usangira na we icaha ciwe.<verse eid="LEV 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />Ntuze wihore canke ngo ugumanire inzigo uwo mu bwoko bwanyu, ariko uze ukunde mugenzawe nk’uko wikunda. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />Muze mwitondere ivyo nategetse.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">Ntimuze mubangurire ibikoko ku bindi bidahuje ubwoko.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">Ntimuze mutere mu mirima yanyu imbuto z’ubwoko bubiri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">Ntimuze mwambare impuzu zijishwe mu nyuzi z’ubwoko bubiri.<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />Umugabo niyaryamana n’umwigeme w’umugurano arehejwe n’uwundi ariko ataracungurwa canke ngo aronke ukwidegemvya, aze ahanwe bikwiye. Ariko ntibaze bicwe, kuko uwo mwigeme atari bwaronke umwidegemvyo. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Ariko uwo mugabo we, aze ashikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> impfizi y’intama imbere y’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro, impfizi y’intama y’ikimazi c’indishi gishikanirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Umuherezi aze amutangire ikimazi imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akoresheje ico kimazi co kwikurako icaha, kubera icaha yakoze, na we azoharirwa icaha ciwe.<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />Nimwashika mu gihugu mugatera igiti c’icamwa ico ari co cose, muze mumare imyaka itatu mufata ko ivyamwa vyaco ari ibizira; ntibize biribwe. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Umwaka ugira kane, ivyamwa vyaco bizoba ari ivyera, ishikanwa ryo guhimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Ariko mu mwaka ugira gatanu muremerewe kurya ivyamwa vyaco. Nimwakora uko, ni ho umwimbu wanyu uzogwira. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />Ntimuze murye inyama zikirimwo amaraso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:26">Ntimuze mukoreshe ivy’ubupfumu no guhamagara imizimu.<verse eid="LEV 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" />Ntimuze mumwe umushatsi wo mu misaya yanyu canke ubwanwa bwanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" />Ntimuze mwikebagure ku mibiri yanyu kubera abapfuye canke ngo mwishushanyeko ibintu ku mibiri. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />Ntimuze mutetereze umukobwa wanyu mu kumushorera mu bumaraya, kuko vyohava bikwegera igihugu kwuzura ubumaraya n’ubundi bubi.<verse eid="LEV 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />Muze mwitondere amasabato yanje kandi mwubahe ahera hanje. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />Ntimuze muhindukirire abahamagara imizimu canke abanyamareba, kuko bobanduza. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />Uze uhaguruke kubera icubahiro c’umutama, wubahe abakuruta kandi uhe icubahiro Imana yawe. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />Umuntu w’umunyamahanga niyaba muri mwebwe, ntimuze mumufate nabi. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Umunyamahanga aba muri mwebwe aze afatwe nk’imvukira. Mumukunde nk’uko mwikunda, kuko mwari inyambukira muri Egiputa. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />Ntimuze mukoreshe ingero zidakwiye iyo muriko murapima uburebure, uburemere canke ubwinshi. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />Muze mukoreshe iminzane itabesha, ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ingero efa imwe yari nk’amalitiro 22.</char></note> ikwiye n’ingero hini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ingero hini imwe yari nk’amalitiro 3,8.</char></note> y’ukuri. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, nabakuye mu gihugu ca Egiputa.<verse eid="LEV 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />Muze muzigame amategeko n’amabwirizwa yanje yose mwongere muyitondere. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyaha n’ibihano bijanye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" />“Vugana n’Abisirayeli ubabwire uti: ‘Umwisirayeli canke umunyamahanga aba muri mwebwe azotanga umwe mu bana biwe ngo ashikanirwe ikigirwamana Moleki aze yicwe. Abantu b’ubwoko bwanyu baze bamwicishe amabuye. <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />Igitsure canje nzogishira kuri uwo muntu kandi nzomukura mu bwoko bwiwe; kuko azoba ahumanije ahera hanje kandi atukishije izina ryanje, mu gutanga abana biwe kw’ibimazi vya Moleki. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Abantu nibirabira hirya igihe uwo muntu azotanga umwe mu bana biwe kuri Moleki ntibamwice, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />nzohindukiriza igitsure canje kuri abo bantu n’imiryango yabo kandi nzobakura mu bwoko bwabo. Ivyo bizoba kuri we no ku bamukurikira mu kwihumanisha ico kigirwamana Moleki.<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />Igitsure canje kizoba ku muntu wese ahamagara imizimu n’abapfumu akihumanisha kuvyizigira no kubikurikira. Nzomuca mu muryango wiwe.<verse eid="LEV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />Mwitange mube abera, kuko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Mugumye ivyo nabategetse kandi mubikurikize. Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabeza.<verse eid="LEV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" />Nihagira uwo muri mwebwe avuma se canke nyina, aze yicwe. Kuko yavumye se canke nyina, amaraso yiwe azoje ku mutwe wiwe.<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />Umugabo azosambana n’umugore w’uwundi mugabo, ni ukuvuga umugore wa mugenziwe, uwo mugabo n’uwo mugore bompi baze bicwe.<verse eid="LEV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" />Umugabo niyasambana na muka se, azoba atetereje se. Uwo mugabo n’uwo mugore bompi baze bicwe; amaraso yabo azoje ku mitwe yabo.<verse eid="LEV 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />Umugabo niyasambana n’umukazana wiwe, bompi baze bicwe. Kuko bazoba bakoze ikizira; amaraso yabo azoje ku mitwe yabo ubwabo.<verse eid="LEV 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />Umugabo niyasambana n’uwundi mugabo nk’uko umugabo asambana n’umugore, bompi bazoba bakoze ivyo kwankwa urunuka. Baze bicwe; amaraso yabo azoje ku mitwe yabo ubwabo.<verse eid="LEV 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />Umugabo niyarongora umugore na nyina w’uwo mugore, ico ni ubuyobe, yaba uwo mugabo, baba abo bagore, bose baze baturirwe, kugira ngo mukure ubuyobe muri mwebwe.<verse eid="LEV 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" />Umugabo niyasambana n’igikoko, aze yicwe, kandi n’ico gikoko muze mucice.<verse eid="LEV 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />Umugore niyasambana n’igikoko, muze mwice uwo mugore n’ico gikoko. Vyompi bize vyicwe kandi amaraso yavyo azoje ku mutwe wiwe n’uw’ico gikoko.<verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />Umugabo niyarongora mushikiwe, yaba uwo bavukana kuri se canke kuri nyina, bakaryamana, ni agatetereza. Baze bakurwe imbere yanyu. Kuko azoba yatetereje mushikiwe, azobizire.<verse eid="LEV 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />Umugabo niyaryamana n’umugore ari mu miziro y’ukwezi, aze azire ko yerekanye isoko y’amaraso y’uwo mugore, uwo mugore na we ko yemeye kwiyambura no kuyerekana. Bompi baze bakurwe mu bwoko bwabo, kuko bemeranije kwerekana isoko y’amaraso y’uwo mugore.<verse eid="LEV 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />Ntihaze hagire uwuryamana na nyinabo canke na inasenge, kuko kwoba ari ugutetereza incuti ya hafi; kandi bompi ntibaze babure kubizira.<verse eid="LEV 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />Umugabo niyaryamana na muka sewabo canke na muka inarume, azoba atetereje sewabo canke inarume. Bompi bazobizira; bazopfa batavyaye.<verse eid="LEV 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />Umugabo niyarongora muramuwe, kizoba ari igikorwa gitera guhumana. Nta mwana bazoronka, kuko azoba atetereje uwo bavukana.<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />Muze muzigame ivyo nabategetse vyose, n’amabwirizwa yanje yose, kandi muze mubikurikize, kugira ngo igihugu ngiye kubaha ntikize kibadahwe. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Ntimuze mukore ivyo amahanga ngiye gusohora imbere yanyu akora, kuko yakoze ivyo vyose nababujije, nanje nca ndayazinukwa. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Ariko mwebwe nababwiye nti: “Muzoragwa igihugu cabo; nzokibaha nk’iragi, ico gihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki.” Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, yabatoranije mu yandi mahanga.<verse eid="LEV 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />Mukwiye rero gutandukanya ibikoko bihumanye n’ibidahumanye, n’ibiguruka bihumanye n’ibidahumanye. Ntimuze mwihumanishe igikoko na kimwe canke ikiguruka na kimwe canke igikwega inda hasi, ivyo nababwiye ko bihumanye kuri mwebwe. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Mumbere abera kuko jewe, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ndi uwera, kandi nabatoranije mu yandi mahanga ngo mumbere ihanga niharije.<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />Umugabo canke umugore ahamagara imizimu canke abapfumu ari muri mwebwe aze yicwe. Muze mumwicishe amabuye; amaraso yiwe azoje ku mutwe wiwe ubwiwe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyagezwe bigenga Abaherezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: “Vugana n’abaherezi, abahungu ba Aroni, ubabwire uti: ‘Ntihaze hagire umuherezi yihumanisha umuvyimba w’umuntu n’umwe w’incuti yiwe yapfuye, <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />kiretse incuti ya hafi, nka nyina canke se, umuhungu wiwe canke umukobwa wiwe, uwo bavukana w’umuhungu, <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />canke mushikiwe akiba iwe kuko atararongorwa; kuko abikoze ashobora kwihumanya. <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Ntaze yihumanishe ab’iwabo n’umugore, ngo bitume ahumana.<verse eid="LEV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" />Abaherezi ntibaze bimoshe umushatsi wose canke ubwanwa bwose canke ngo bikebagure ku mibiri yabo. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Baze babere Imana yabo abera kandi ntibaze batukishe izina ry’Imana yabo. Kuko ari bo bashikana ibimazi bituririwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ari zo mfungurwa z’Imana yabo; ni co gituma bakwiye kuba abera.<verse eid="LEV 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />Ntibaze barongore abagore bahumanijwe n’ubumaraya canke bahukanye n’abagabo babo, kuko abaherezi ari abejerejwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Muze mubafate nk’abera, kuko bashikanira Imana yanyu imfungurwa. Muze mubafate nk’abera, kuko jewe, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ndi uwera kandi ni jewe ndabeza.<verse eid="LEV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />Umukobwa w’umuherezi niyiyandurisha kuba maraya, azoba atetereje se; aze aturirwe mu muriro.<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />Umuherezi mukuru, umwe muri bamwe bavukana yasutswe ku mutwe ya mavuta yo kumurobanura, agatoranirizwa kuzokwambara za mpuzu z’ubuherezi, ntaze yigere asambura umushatsi canke ngo yitabagurireko impuzu. <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />Ntaze yigere yinjira ahari umuvyimba w’umuntu. Ntaze yigere yiyandurisha umuvyimba naho yoba ari se canke nyina, <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />canke ngo ave ahera h’Imana yiwe, canke ngo ahahumanye, kuko yatoranijwe asizwe amavuta yo kurobanura y’Imana yiwe. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />Umuherezi mukuru aze arongore umukobwa akiri isugi. <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Ntaze arongore umupfakazi, uwahukanye, canke uwihumanishije kuba maraya, ahubwo aze arongore umukobwa akiri isugi wo mu bwoko bwiwe, <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />kugira ngo ntahumanye uruvyaro rwiwe mu bwoko bwiwe. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni jewe ndamweza.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />“Bwira Aroni uti: ‘Uko urunganwe ruzokurikirana n’urundi, ntihaze hagire uwo mu ruvyaro rwawe afise agasembwa azokwegera ngo ahereze imfungurwa z’Imana yiwe. <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />Ntihaze hagire uwufise agasembwa yegera ngo abikore, ari impumyi canke ikimuga, afise agasembwa mu maso, canke afise ubumuga bundi; <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />amugaye ikirenge canke ikiganza, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />uwufise inyonzo canke ari impfunya, uwupfuye ijisho, uwugwaye uruhere, canke ibisebe biva amazi, canke uwamenetse amatengatwa. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Ntihaze hagire uwukomoka kuri Aroni umuherezi afise agasembwa azokwegera kugira ngo ashikane ishikanwa rituririrwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Uwufise agasembwa ntaze yegere guhereza imfungurwa z’Imana yiwe. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Ashobora kurya kuri za mfungurwa zera z’Imana yiwe, no ku zera zose; <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />ariko kubera ubumuga bwiwe, ntaze yegere ca gihuzu gikingira ahera cane canke ngo yegere igicaniro, kuko yohava ahumanya ahera hanje. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi ni jewe ndabeza.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Nuko Mose abibwira Aroni n’abahungu biwe n’Abisirayeli bose.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />“Barira Aroni n’abahungu biwe bitondere cane amashikanwa Abisirayeli bateguye kunshikanira, kugira ngo ntibahumanye izina ryanje. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />Ubabwire uti: ‘Uko urunganwe ruzokurikirana n’urundi, nihagira umwe wo mu ruvyaro rwanyu azoba ahumanye ariko akegera amashikanwa yera Abisirayeli bangeneye jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, uwo muntu aze akurwe imbere yanje. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />Uwo mu ruvyaro rwa Aroni azogwara imibembe canke akagira ibimuva mu bihimba vy’irondoka, ntaze arye ku bimazi vyera gushika igihe azohumanurirwa. Azoba kandi ahumanye niyakora ku kintu candujwe n’umuvyimba canke n’umuntu yasheshe imbuto ziwe, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />canke niyakora ku gakoko gatoya kose gashobora kumuhumanya, canke ku muntu wese yomuhumanya, ubuhumane ubwo ari bwo bwose. <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />Uwuzokora ku kintu nk’ico azoba ahumanye gushika ku mugoroba. Ntaze yegere ibimazi vyera kiretse amaze kwiyuhagira n’amazi. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Izuba niryarenga, azoba ahumanuwe, hanyuma yaho azoba yemerewe kurya ku bimazi vyera, kuko ari imfungurwa ziwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Ntaze arye igikoko capfuye ata wucishe canke icatabaguwe n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba, kuko yohava avyiyandurisha. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />Abaherezi baze bitondere ivyo nihanikirije vyose kugira ngo ntibaze batsindwe n’urubanza bagahava bapfa bazize ko babikengereye. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi ni jewe ndabeza.<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />Ntihaze hagire umuntu atari uwo mu muryango w’abaherezi, umushitsi agendeye umuherezi canke umukozi wiwe, arya ku bimazi vyera. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Ariko uwo muherezi niyagura umugurano n’amahera yiwe, canke niyaba ari umugurano yavukiye mu nzu yiwe, uwo mugurano ashobora kurya ku ndya ziwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Umukobwa w’umuherezi niyarongorwa n’uwundi muntu atari umuherezi, ntazoba yemerewe kurya ku vyera vyashikaniwe Imana. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Ariko umukobwa w’umuherezi niyaba umupfakazi canke akahukana, kandi ata bana araronka, hanyuma agasubira mu nzu kwa se nk’uko yari ari atararongorwa, azoba yemerewe kurya kuri izo ndya za se. Nta muntu n’umwe atabifitiye uburenganzira akwiye kurya kuri izo ndya.<verse eid="LEV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />Nihagira uwurya ku bimazi vyera atabizi, aze arihe uwo muherezi ico kimazi yariye yongereko ica gatanu c’ikiguzi caco. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />Abaherezi ntibaze bakengereze ibimazi vyera Abisirayeli bashikaniye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />mu kubemerera kubiryako bikabazanira gutsindwa, maze bigatuma batanga indishi. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi ni jewe ndabeza.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibimazi bitemerwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />“Vugana na Aroni n’abahungu biwe n’Abisirayeli bose uti: ‘Nihagira n’umwe wo muri mwebwe, yaba Umwisirayeli canke umunyamahanga aba muri mwebwe, azotanga impano y’ikimazi co guturirira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, caba ari ico gushitsa isezerano canke ico atanze avyishakiye, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />aze atange ishuri itagira agasembwa akuye mu busho bwiwe, intama canke impene, kugira ngo ikimazi ciwe cemerwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" />Ntimuze muzane igikoko na kimwe gifise agasembwa, kuko kitazokwemerwa nk’ikimazi mutanze. <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />Nihagira uwuzana ikivuye mu masho canke mu mikuku kw’ikimazi c’ishimwe k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> co gushitsa isezerano canke co gushikana kuko avyishakiye, kize kibe ikitagira agasembwa canke umugayo kugira ngo cemerwe. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Ntimuze mushikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> icahumye, icamugaye canke icacitse amaboko canke amaguru, icagwaye urukoma canke uruhere canke ibisebe. Ntimuze muzane ku gicaniro ikimazi kimeze gityo ngo kibe ikimazi gishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> giturizwa umuriro. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Mushobora kuzana ikimazi mutanze muvyishakiye; ishuri, intama canke impene ifise ukuguru canke ukuboko kugufi cane canke kurekure cane canke ngufi cane, ariko ntikizokwemerwa nk’ikimazi co gushitsa isezerano. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Ntimuze mushikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igikoko gifise amatengatwa yamenetse, yajanjaguritse canke yacitse. Ntimuze mubikorere mu gihugu canyu, <verse eid="LEV 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />kandi ntimuze mwemere ibikoko nk’ivyo mubihawe n’umunyamahanga ngo mubitange nk’imfungurwa z’Imana yanyu. Ntibizokwemerwa, kuko bimugaye kandi bifise agasembwa.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />“Nihavuka inyana, umwagazi w’intama canke w’impene, ize igumane na nyina imisi indwi. Kuva ku musi ugira umunani kubandanya, izoba yemewe gutangwa kw’ikimazi co guturirira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Ntimuze mukerere inka canke intama n’inyana canke n’umwagazi wayo ku musi umwe.<verse eid="LEV 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />Nimwatanga ikimazi co gukenguruka k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, muze mugitange ku buryo cemerwa. <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Kize kiribwe kuri uwo musi nyene; ntimuze musigaze na kimwe gushika mu gitondo. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />Muze mwitwararike ivyo ndabategeka kandi mubigendere. Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Ntimuze mukengereze izina ryanje. Ukwera kwanje gukwiye kumenyekana mu Bisirayeli. Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nabejeje <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />ndabakuye mu gihugu ca Egiputa kugira ngo ndababere Imana. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ikirangamisi c’imisi mikuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" />“Vugana n’Abisirayeli ubabwire uti: ‘Iyi ni yo misi mikuru nashinze, jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, iyo mukwiye gutangaza no kumenyesha ko ari iyera.<verse eid="LEV 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Isabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" />Mufise imisi itandatu yo gukora, ariko umusi ugira indwi ni Isabato yo kuruhuka, umusi w’ihuriro ryera. Ntimuze mugire igikorwa na kimwe mukora kuri uwo musi; aho muba hose, izoba ari Isabato y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Pasika n’imikate itarimwo umwambiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />Iyi ni yo misi mikuru <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yashinze, amakoraniro yera mukwiye kumenyesha mu bihe vyayo: <verse eid="LEV 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" />Pasika y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> itangura ku mugoroba izuba rirenze ku musi ugira icumi na kane w’ukwezi kwa mbere. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Ku musi ugira icumi na gatanu w’ukwo kwezi, hazoba umusi mukuru w’imikate itambiye w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; muze mumare imisi indwi murya imikate itarimwo umwambiro. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Ku musi wa mbere muze mugire ikoraniro ryera kandi ntimuze mugire igikorwa muwukorako. <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />Muze mumare imisi indwi mushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikimazi co guturirwa. Hanyuma ku musi ugira indwi muze mugire ikoraniro ryera kandi ntimuze mugire igikorwa muwukorako.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Umusi mukuru w’ivyeze ubwa mbere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" />“Vugana n’Abisirayeli ubabwire uti: ‘Nimwinjira mu gihugu ngiye kubaha, hanyuma mukimbura ivyeze muri co, muze muzanire umuherezi umukama w’ivyeze imbere y’ibindi mu vyo mwimbuye. <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />Na we aze azungagize uwo mukama imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, na wo uzokwemerwa ku bwanyu; uwo muherezi aze awuzungagize ku musi ukurikira Isabato. <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Ku musi wo kuzungagiza uwo mukama, muze mutange umwagazi w’intama umaze umwaka kandi utagira agasembwa kw’ikimazi co guturirwa, <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />hamwe n’ishikanwa ry’ifu ingana na bibiri vy’icumi vy’ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 3,2</char></note> y’ifu inoze neza ivanze n’amavuta; ishikanwa ryo guturirwa rishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ubumote bwiza; hamwe n’ishikanwa ry’ica kane c’ingero hini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ilitiro imwe</char></note> y’umuvinyu. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Ntimuze murye umukate n’umwe, intete zikaranze canke intete nshasha, kugeza kuri uwo musi muzotanga ico kimazi ku Mana yanyu. Iri rize ribe ibwirizwa rihoraho uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikirana n’urundi, aho muzoba muba hose.<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Umusi mukuru w’amayinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />Kuva ku musi ukurikira isabato, ari wo musi mwazanyeko wa mukama w’ishikanwa ryo kuzunguza, muze muharure amayinga indwi yuzuye. <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Muze muharure imisi mirongo itanu kugeza ku musi ukurikira Isabato igira indwi, hanyuma muce mutanga ishikanwa ry’ifu nshasha k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Kuva aho muba hose, muze muzane imikate ibiri, umwe wose ukozwe muri bibiri vya cumi vy’ingero efa y’ifu inoze neza, kandi ikaranze irimwo n’umwambiro, nk’ishikanwa ryo kuzungagiza ry’ivyeze imbere y’ibindi rishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Muze mutange uwo mukate hamwe n’impfizi z’intama indwi zikiri imyagazi, umwagazi wose uzobe umaze umwaka kandi utagira agasembwa, n’ishuri ikiri nto n’impfizi zibiri z’intama; ivyo bibe ibimazi vyo guturirirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ishikanwa ritanzwe hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ifu n’amashikanwa y’ibinyobwa bijanye, ari ryo shikanwa riturirwa rikaba ubumote bwiza buhimbara <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Hanyuma muze mushikane isuguru y’impene, ibe ikimazi c’ivyaha, hamwe n’imyagazi y’intama ibiri, imaze umwaka, ibe ikimazi c’ishimwe. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Umuherezi aze azungagize iyo myagazi ibiri imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’ishikanwa ryo kuzungagiza, hamwe na wa mukate ukozwe mu vyimburwa vyeze imbere y’ibindi. Bizoba ari ishikanwa ryera k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi rizoba ari iry’umuherezi. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Kuri uwo musi nyene, muze mutangaze ikoraniro ryera kandi ntihaze hagire igikorwa na kimwe mukora. Iryo rize ribe itegeko rihoraho uko urunganwe ruzokurikirana n’urundi, aho muzoba muba hose.<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />Nimwimbura ivyo mu gihugu canyu, ntimuze mwimbure ivyameze hirya y’urubibe rwanyu canke ngo musubire inyuma gutoragura ivyasigaye mu mirima. Muze mubirekere abakene n’inyambukira. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Umusi mukuru w’Inzamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" />“Barira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Umusi wa mbere w’ukwezi kw’indwi muze muwuruhukeko, ribe ikoraniro ryera muhimbarisha kuvuza inzamba. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Ntimuze mugire igikorwa muwukorako ariko muze mushikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikimazi co guturirwa.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Umusi w’impongano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />“Umusi ugira icumi w’uko kwezi kw’indwi uzobe umusi wo gutanga ikimazi co kwicungura. Muze mugire ikoraniro ryera mwisonzeshe, kandi mushikanire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ikimazi co guturirwa. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Ntimuze mukore kuri uwo musi, kuko uzoba ari umusi wo gutanga ikimazi co kwicungura, umusi mutangirako ikimazi gituma mwemerwa n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Umuntu wese atazokwisonzesha kuri uwo musi aze arandurwe mu bwoko bwiwe. <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Nzorandura mu muryango wiwe umuntu wese azogira ico akoze kuri uwo musi. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Ntihaze hagire ikintu na kimwe mukora. Iri rize ribe itegeko rihoraho uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikirana n’urundi, aho muzoba muba hose. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Izoba ari Isabato yo kuruhuka kuri mwebwe, kandi muze mwisonzeshe. Kuva ku mugoroba w’umusi ugira icenda w’uko kwezi gushika ku mugoroba ukurikira muze mwitondere Isabato yanyu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Umusi mukuru w’insago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" />“Barira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Ku musi ugira icumi na gatanu w’ukwezi kw’indwi ni ho umusi mukuru w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> w’insago uzoba utanguye, kandi uzomara imisi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Umusi wa mbere uze ube uw’ikoraniro ryera; ntimuze muwukoreko igikorwa na kimwe. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Muze mumare imisi indwi mushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimazi vyo guturirwa, hanyuma ku musi ugira umunani muze mugire ikoraniro ryera, mushikane ibimazi bituririrwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Rizoba ari ikoraniro ryo gusozera; ntimuze mugire igikorwa na kimwe muwukorako.<verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />(Iyo ni yo misi mikuru itegetswe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Muze muyihimbaze mukoranya amakoraniro yejejwe yo gutanga kw’ibimazi vyo guturirira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’amashikanwa y’ifu, ibimazi n’amashikanwa vy’ibinyobwa vyategetswe ku musi ku musi. <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />Ivyo bimazi ni ibizoba vyiyongera kuri bimwe bitangwa ku masabato y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no kuri vya bimazi mutanga nk’ingabire, no kuri bimwe vyo gushitsa isezerano n’ivyo mutanga muvyishakiye mukabishikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.)<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />Nuko rero kuva ku musi ugira icumi na gatanu w’ukwezi kw’indwi, mumaze kwimbura ivyimburwa vyo mu gihugu, muze muhimbaze umusi mukuru w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uzomara imisi indwi; umusi wa mbere uzoba ari uwo kuruhuka, n’umusi w’umunani na wo nyene ni uwo kuruhuka. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Ku musi wa mbere muze muzane ibirusha ibindi kuba vyiza mu vyamye ku biti, amashami y’ibigazi, amashami y’ibiti vy’amababi maninimanini n’ibiti bimera i ruhande y’amazi atemba, hanyuma munezererwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu kumara imisi indwi. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Muze muwuhimbaze nk’umusi mukuru w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uzomara imisi indwi uko umwaka utashe. Iri rize ribe itegeko rihoraho uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikirana n’urundi; muze muwuhimbaze mu kwezi kw’indwi. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Muze mube mu nsago kumara imisi indwi: Abisirayeli bose b’imvukira baze babe mu nsago <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />kugira ngo abana banyu baze bamenye ko jewe natumye Abisirayeli baba mu nsago igihe nabakura mu gihugu ca Egiputa. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Nuko Mose amenyesha Abisirayeli imisi mikuru yose yashinzwe n’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s1">Amatara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />“Ubarire Abisirayeli bazane amavuta ya elayo ateguwe neza yo gucana amatara, kugira ngo azogume yaka ibihe vyose. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Mw’Ihema ry’Ibonaniro, hino y’igitambara gikingira Isandugu y’Isezerano, ni ho Aroni azoyatereka kugira ngo yame yaka adahengeshanya imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuva ku mugoroba gushika mu gitondo. Iryo rize ribe ibwirizwa rihoraho uko urunganwe ruzogenda rukurikirana n’urundi. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Ayo matara aze yame ashirwa ku giterekwako amatara c’inzahabu itavanze imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ubudasiba.<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />Muze mufate ifu mucumbe imikate icumi n’ibiri, mukoresheje bibiri vya cumi vy’ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo ibilo 3,2.</char></note> ku mukate umwe umwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Muze muyitondeke ku mirongo ibiri, ku murongo wose hajeko itandatu itandatu, ku meza ikozwe mu nzahabu itavanze imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Muze mushire ibimota neza i ruhande y’umurongo wose, bibe ku mikate nk’icibutso, nk’ishikanwa riturirwa imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Iyo mikate ize yame ishirwa imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ubudasiba, uko Isabato ikurikirana n’iyindi, kubw’Abisirayeli, nk’isezerano ridahera. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" />Izoba ari iya Aroni n’abahungu biwe, na bo baze bayirire ahera, kuko ari umugabane wera cane bagerewe kuzohora baronka ku mashikanwa atuririwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uwatutse Imana akwiye kwicishwa amabuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Umusi umwe habaye amatati aho bari bacumbitse, hagati y’Umwisirayeli n’umuhungu yari afise se w’Umunyegiputa na nyina w’Umwisirayelikazi. <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" />Maze uwo muhungu w’Umunyegiputa n’Umwisirayelikazi atuka rya Zina ararivuma; maze baca bamuzanira Mose. (Nyina wiwe yitwa Shelomite, umukobwa wa Diburi wo mu muryango wa Dani.) <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />Baca bamushira mw’ibohero gushika bamenyeshejwe neza ubugombe bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />Nuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />“Sohora uwo yatutse izina ryanje inyuma y’aho mucumbitse. Maze abamwumvise bose babe ari bo barambika ibiganza ku mutwe wiwe, maze ikoraniro ryose rimwicishe amabuye. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Bwira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Nihagira uwuvuma Izina ry’Imana yiwe, azobizira; <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />umuntu wese azotuka izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aze yicwe. Ikoraniro ryose rize rimwicishe amabuye. Yaba imvukira canke umunyamahanga aba muri mwebwe; niyatuka iryo zina, aze yicwe.<verse eid="LEV 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />Nihagira uwica umuntu, na we aze yicwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />Nihagira uwica igitungano c’uwundi aze akirihe, ubugingo bwishurwe ubundi. <verse eid="LEV 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />Umuntu niyakomeretsa mugenziwe, ico azoba yakoze na we aze agikorerwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />Imvune ihorwe iyindi, ijisho rihorwe irindi, iryinyo rihorwe irindi. Uko azoba yakomerekeje mugenziwe, na we aze abe ari ko akomeretswa. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Uwishe igikoko aze akirihe, ariko uwishe umuntu aze yicwe. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" />Muze mugire itegeko rimwe ku munyamahanga n’imvukira. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />Nuko Mose avugana n’Abisirayeli, na bo bafata wa muntu yatutse izina ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bamujana inyuma y’aho bacumbitse. Abisirayeli bakora nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yategetse Mose.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s1">Umwaka w’Isabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Mose ari ku musozi Sinayi ati: <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" />“Vugana n’Abisirayeli ubabwire uti: ‘Nimwinjira igihugu ngiye kubaha, ico gihugu ubwaco kize cubahirize Isabato y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Muze murime imirima yanyu imyaka itandatu, kandi muri iyo myaka itandatu muze mututurire imizabibu yanyu mwongere mwegeranye ivyimburwa vyayo. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Ariko mu mwaka ugira indwi isi ize ironke akaruhuko k’Isabato, Isabato y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ntimuze mubibe canke ngo mutere ikintu na kimwe mu mirima yanyu canke ngo mututurire imizabibu yanyu. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Ntimuze mwimbure ivyimejeje muri yo kandi ntimuze mwamure imizabibu yamye ku biti bidatuturiye. Isi ize ironke umwaka w’akaruhuko. <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />Ivyo imirima izokwama vyose bize bibe ivyokurya vyanyu, mwebwe ubwanyu, abagurano banyu n’abaguranokazi banyu, n’abakozi banyu canke abashitsi bari i wanyu, <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />n’ibitungano vyanyu n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba vyo mu gihugu canyu. Ivyo igihugu kimejeje vyose bishobora kuribwa.<verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwaka wa Yubile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />Muze muharure amasabato indwi y’imyaka, ni ukuvuga imyaka indwi incuro indwi, kugira ngo ayo masabato indwi y’imyaka akwize imyaka mirongo ine n’icenda. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Hanyuma muzoce muvuza inzamba hose ku musi ugira icumi w’ukwezi kw’indwi; ku musi wo gutanga ikimazi co kwicungura muze muvuze inzamba mu gihugu cose. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Muze mweze umwaka ugira mirongo itanu muri mu gihugu mwamamaze umwidegemvyo ku bakibamwo bose. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Uwo mwaka ugira mirongo itanu uze ube Yubile kuri mwebwe; ntimuze mugire ico mubiba canke mutera ngo mugire ico mwimbura ku vyimejeje canke ngo mwamure inzabibu ku mizabibu mutatuturiye. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Kuko izoba ari Yubile kandi izoba ari iyejejwe kuri mwebwe; muze murye ivyo mwamuye mu mirima.<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />Muri uwo mwaka wa Yubile umuntu wese aze asubire mw’itongo ryiwe.<verse eid="LEV 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />Nimwagurisha itongo ku wo mu bwoko bwanyu canke mukarimugurira, ntihaze hagire uwuzimba uwundi. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Muze mugure amatongo y’abo mu bwoko bwanyu mukurikije imyaka mumaze Yubile ibaye. Kandi muze mugurishe amatongo kuri bagenzi banyu mukurikije imyaka isigaye yo kwimbura mu mirima yanyu. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Imyaka niyaba ari myinshi, muze muduze igiciro, na ho niyaba ari mike, muze mumanure igiciro, kuko ico muzoba muriko muragurisha ari igitigiri c’ibihe vyo kwimbura. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Ntihaze hagire uwurenganya uwundi, ariko muze mutinye Imana yanyu. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />Muze mukurikize amategeko yanje kandi mwitwaririke kwumvira ivyagezwe vyanje, ni ho muzoba amahoro muri ico gihugu. <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Aho ni ho igihugu kizokwera ivyamwa vyaco, namwe muzorya muhage kandi muzokibamwo mu mutekano. <verse eid="LEV 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />Mwoshobora kubaza muti: “Tuzorya iki mu mwaka ugira indwi nitutatera ngo twimbure ivyimburwa vyacu?” <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />Nzobarungikira umugisha mu mwaka ugira gatandatu ku buryo imirima izotanga ivyimburwa vyo kubatunga imyaka itatu. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Mu gihe co kubiba mu mwaka ugira umunani, muzoba mukirya ibihitira kandi muzokomeza kubirya gushika aho muzokwimburira ivyo mu mwaka ugira icenda.<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />Ntihaze hagire uwugurisha itongo rimwe burundu, kuko amatongo ari ayanje namwe mukaba ba kavantara n’abakozi banje. <verse eid="LEV 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />Mu gihugu cose muhawe ngo mucegukire, muze mutegurire amatongo igihe co gucungurwa.<verse eid="LEV 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />Umwisirayeli wo mu bwoko bwanyu niyakena akagurisha igice c’itongo ryiwe, uwo mu ncuti ziwe za hafi aze acungure rya tongo yagurishije. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Ariko uwo muntu niyaba atagira uwo kumucungurira iryo tongo, ariko hanyuma agatunga akaronka ivyo kuricungura, <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />aze aharure ikiguzi gikwiranye n’igihe rimaze uhereye igihe yarigurisha ace asubiza ayasigaye uwari yariguze; aho rero azoce asubirana itongo ryiwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Ariko nataronka ivyo kurigaruza, aho yagurishije haze hagume ari aha nyene kuhagura kugeza ku mwaka wa Yubile. Haze hasubizwe kuri Yubile, hasubire kuba aha nyeneho.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />Umuntu niyagurisha inzu iri mu gisagara kizitijwe inzitiro, azoba ashobora kuyicungura mu kiringo c’umwaka kuva igurishijwe. Muri ico kiringo gusa ni ho azoba ashobora kuyicungura. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Niyaba atashoboye kuyicungura ico kiringo kikamurengana, iyo nzu iri mu gisagara kizitijwe uruzitiro ize yegukire nyene kuyigura n’uruvyaro rwiwe. Ntize isubizwe mu gihe ca Yubile. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Ariko inzu ziri mu mihana ahantu hatagira inzitiro zize zifatwe nk’amatongo. Zirashobora gucungurwa, kandi zize zisubizwe kuri Yubile.<verse eid="LEV 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />Abalewi bazokwama bafise uburenganzira bwo gucungura inzu zabo ziri mu bisagara vyagerewe Abalewi. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Nuko rero amatongo y’Abalewi ashobora gucungurwa; yaba inzu yagurishijwe iri mu gisagara ico ari co cose bagabiwe, kandi ize isubizwe mu gihe ca Yubile, kuko inzu muri ivyo bisagara vy’Abalewi ari umugabane wabo mu Bisirayeli. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Ariko ahantu h’uburagiro bwegukira ibisagara vyabo ntivyemewe kuhagurisha; ni umugabane wabo imyaka yose.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />Umuntu wo mu bwoko bwanyu niyakena ntashobore kuronka ikimutunga kimubeshaho, muze mumufashe nk’uko mwobikorera umunyamahanga canke inyambukira iri muri mwebwe, kugira ngo ashobore kubaho muri mwebwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" />Ntimuze murondere kumuronkako inyungu iyo ari yo yose, ariko muze mwubahe Imana yanyu, kugira ngo uwo muntu wo mu bwoko bwanyu ashishikare kuba muri mwebwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" />Ntimuze mumugurane amahera mwiteze ko abungukira canke ngo mumugurisheko ivyo gufungura mugomba kumwungukako. <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, nabakuye mu gihugu ca Egiputa kugira ngo ndabahe igihugu c’i Kanani nongere ndababere Imana.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />Nihagira uwo mu bwoko bwanyu aba umukene ari muri mwebwe hanyuma akigurisha kuri mwebwe, ntimuze mumukoreshe nk’umugurano. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />Aze akoreshwe nk’umukozi aca ingero canke nk’umunyamahanga aba muri mwebwe, aze abakorere gushika ku mwaka wa Yubile. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Hanyuma we n’abana biwe baze bidegemvye, na we aze asubire mu muryango wiwe no mw’itongo rya ba sekuruza. <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />Kuko Abisirayeli ari abakozi banje, abo naguze nkabakura muri Egiputa, ntibaze bagurishwe nk’abagurano. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Ntimuze mubatwaze igitugu, ariko mwubahe Imana yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />Abagurano n’abaguranokazi banyu baze bave mu mahanga abakikuje; muri abo ni ho muzoshobora kugura abagurano. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Mushobora kandi kubagura mu bantu b’inyambukira baba muri mwebwe no mu bo mu miryango yabo bavukiye iwanyu, na bo bazoba inyegu zanyu. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Mushobora no kubaraga abahungu banyu kandi mushobora kubatunga nk’abagurano ubuzima bwabo bwose, ariko ntimuze mutwaze amanyama Umwisirayeli mugenzi wanyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />Uwo mu banyamahanga aba muri mwebwe niyatunga maze uwo mu bwoko bwanyu agakena akigurisha kuri uwo munyamahanga aba muri mwebwe canke ku bo mu muryango wiwe, <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />aze agumane uburenganzira bwo gucungurwa amaze kwigurisha, uwo mu ncuti ziwe ashobora kumucungura. <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />Sewabo canke inarume canke muvyarawe canke incuti iyo ari yo yose yo mu muryango wiwe ishobora kumucungura; canke niyatunga, ashobora kwicungura. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />We n’uwo yamuguze baze baharure uhereye umwaka yamuguzemwo kugeza ku mwaka wa Yubile. Igiciro co kumucungura kize giharurwe bakoresheje impembo y’umukozi muri iyo myaka yose. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />Nihaba hasigaye imyaka myinshi, aze arihe igice kinini c’amahera yaguzwe. <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />Nihaba hasigaye imyaka mike ngo Yubile ishike, aze aharure amahera asigaye abe ari yo ariha. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Aze afatwe nk’umukozi yahawe akazi ku mwaka ku mwaka; muze mubikurikirane neza kugira ngo uwo yamuguze ntamutwaze amanyama.<verse eid="LEV 25:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />Naho atoshobora gucungurwa muri ubwo buryo, we n’abana biwe baze bidegemvye mu mwaka wa Yubile, <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />Kuko Abisirayeli ari abakozi banje, abo naguze nkabakura muri Egiputa. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s1">Impembo yo kwumvira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />Ntimuze mukore ibigirwamana canke ngo mwishingire ibishushanyo canke inkingi z’amabuye, kandi ntimuze mushinge ivyabajwe mu mabuye mu gihugu ngo muvyunamire. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="LEV 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />Muze mwitondere amasabato yanje kandi mwubahe ahera hanje. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />Nimwitondera ivyo nashinze, mugashira umutima ku kwitondera amabwirizwa yanje, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" />nzobarungikira imvura mu gihe cayo, kandi isi izokwera ivyimburwa vyayo n’ibiti vyame ivyamwa vyavyo. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Iyimbura ryanyu ry’ingano rizogeza kw’iyimbura ry’inzabibu, n’iyimbura ry’inzabibu rishike mw’ibiba, kandi muzorya ivyo mugomba mube amahoro mu gihugu canyu.<verse eid="LEV 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />Nzobaha amahoro mu gihugu, kandi muzokwiryamira ata kintu kibaca ivutu. Nzokura ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba mu gihugu, kandi nta nkota izoca mu gihugu canyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Muzokinagiza abansi banyu, kandi bazokwicwa n’inkota imbere yanyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Batanu bo muri mwebwe bazokinagiza ijana, n’ijana bo muri mwebwe bakinagize ibihumbi icumi, kandi abansi banyu muzobamarisha inkota.<verse eid="LEV 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />Nzobarabisha ijisho ry’urukundo kandi nzobaha kurondoka mugwire, ngumizeho isezerano nasezeranye namwe. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Muzoba mukirya ivyo mwimbuye umwaka uheze, hanyuma murondere ingene mubisohora kugira ngo muronke aho mwimburira ivyeze. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Nzoshinga ihema ryanje hagati muri mwebwe, kandi sinzobaheba. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" />Nzogendera hagati yanyu, mbe Imana yanyu namwe mube abantu banje. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, nabakuye muri Egiputa kugira ngo muve mu buja bw’Abanyegiputa. Navunaguye ivyuma vy’ingogo vyanyu ndabaha kugenda mwemye.<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibihano ku batumvira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />Ariko nimutanyumvira ngo mwitondere aya mabwirizwa yose, <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />maze mugashiburira kure ivyo nashinze vyose mugakengera ivyagezwe vyanje mukananirwa no kwitondera amabwirizwa yanje yose, mukongera mukava mw’isezerano ryanje, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />nanje uku ni ko nzobagirira: nzobateza ibibaca ivutu, ingwara zidakira n’akaranda bitume muba impumyi bibamare inkomezi. Muzobibira ubusa, kuko abansi banyu ari bo bazobirya. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Igitsure canje kizoguma kuri mwebwe bitume mutsindwa n’abansi banyu; ababanka ni bo bazobaganza, kandi muzohunga ata wubirukanye.<verse eid="LEV 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />Ivyo nibitatuma munyumvira, nzobahanira ivyaha vyanyu incuro indwi. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Nzovunagura ubwibone bwanyu ntume ijuru ribabera nk’icuma isi na yo ibabere nk’umuringa. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Muzoruhira ubusa, kuko igihugu kitazokwera ivyimburwa vyaco, canke ngo ibiti vyo mu gihugu canyu vyame ivyamwa vyavyo.<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />Nimwashishikara kuba abansi banje mukanka kunyumvira, nzogwiza ivyago vyanyu incuro indwi ndabahora ivyaha vyanyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Nzobarungikira ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba bibatere, bibatware abana banyu, bihonye n’amasho yanyu bitume muba inkehwa maze amayira yanyu asigare agaragara.<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />Naho nyene nimwanka kwemera ngo muhanurwe mugashishikara kuba abansi banje, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />nanje nzohinduka umwansi wanyu ndabateze ivyago birushirije incuro indwi kubera ivyaha vyanyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Nzoca ndabateza inkota ndabahoye ko mwavuye mw’isezerano ryanje. Nimwahungira mu bisagara vyanyu nzobateza ikiza kandi muzogwa mu maboko y’abansi banyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Ninazibira aho mukura ivyokurya, abagore icumi bazoshobora gukarangira mu nkono imwe, kandi bazobagaburira ibipimwe, kandi naho muzobirya ntimuzohaga.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />Naho nzoba nabagiriye gutyo, nimwashishikara kuja kure yanje, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />nanje nzobarakira ndabaje kure, kandi jewe ubwanje nzobahanira ivyaha vyanyu incuro indwi. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Muzorya inyama z’abahungu banyu n’abakobwa banyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Nzosambura ibibanza vyanyu vyo gusengeramwo ku misozi, n’ibicaniro vy’ibimota neza vyanyu nzobisenyurira hasi, ngerekeranye imivyimba yanyu ku bigirwamana vyanyu bitagira ubugingo, ndabanke urunuka. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Ibisagara vyanyu nzobihindura imisaka, nsambure ingoro musengeramwo, kandi n’ibimota neza vy’amashikanwa yanyu bizoba igisesema kuri jewe. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Jewe ubwanje nzosambura igihugu canyu, gushika aho abansi banyu bazokigereramwo bazotangara cane. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Nzobasanzariza mu mahanga nsokorore inkota yanje ndabakinagize. Igihugu canyu kizoba amatongo, kandi ibisagara vyanyu bizosigara ari imisaka. <verse eid="LEV 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />Igihugu kizonezererwa imyaka y’amasabato yaco igihe cose kizoba ari amatongo namwe muri mu gihugu c’abansi banyu; igihugu na co kizoruhuka amasabato yaco. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Mu gihe cose kizoba ari amatongo, kizoruhuka akaruhuko k’amasabato kitaruhutse igihe mwari mukiri muri co.<verse eid="LEV 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />Nzotuma abasigaye ari amasigarira baranduka imitima bari mu bihugu vy’abansi babo, ku buryo n’akababi kaguruwe n’umuyaga gatuma bahunga. Bazokwiruka nk’abahunga inkota, maze bagwe hasi, naho ata n’umwe azoba ariko arabakinagiza. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Umuntu azotsitara kuri mugenziwe nk’aho boba bariko barahunga inkota, naho ata n’umwe azoba ariko arabakinagiza. Uko ni ko mutazoshobora guhagarara imbere y’abansi banyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Muzohonera mu mahanga; igihugu c’abansi banyu kizobatsontsomera. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Abazosigara bazohonera mu gihugu c’abansi banyu ku bw’ivyaha vyabo n’ivya ba sekuruza babo.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />Ariko nibatura ivyaha vyabo n’ivya ba sekuruza babo, ubuhemu bwabo n’urwanko banyanka jewe, <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" />rwatumye nanje ndabazinukwa bigatuma ndabirukanira mu gihugu c’abansi babo, maze imitima yabo y’intakebwa igacishwa bugufi bakishura ivyaha bakoze, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" />nzokwibuka isezerano nasezeranye na Yakobo n’iryo nasezeranye na Isaka n’iryo nasezeranye na Aburahamu, bitume nibuka igihugu. <verse eid="LEV 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Kuko igihugu bazokivamwo na co kikanezererwa amasabato yaco igihe kizoba ari amatongo batakikibamwo. Bazokwishura ivyaha bakoze kuko bataye ivyagezwe vyanje bagatera ibitugu ivyo nihanikirije. <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Ariko naho biri uko, igihe bazoba bari mu gihugu c’abansi babo, sinzobata canke ngo ndabahebe ngo bitume ndabaherengeteza rwose, ngo mve mw’isezerano nasezeranye na bo. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo. <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Ariko ku bwabo nzokwibuka isezerano nasezeranye na ba sekuruza babo, abo nakuye mu gihugu ca Egiputa amahanga yose abibona, ngo mbe Imana yabo. Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Ivyo ni vyo vyashinzwe, vyagezwe n’amabwirizwa, ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yashingiye ku musozi Sinayi, hagati yiwe n’Abisirayeli abicishije kuri Mose.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s1">Gucungura ibintu vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abwira Mose ati: <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" />“Vugana n’Abisirayeli ubabwire uti: ‘Umuntu niyasezerana isezerano ryo gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> umuntu, aze abikore abicishije mu gutanga amahera angana n’igiciro ciwe, <verse eid="LEV 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />muze mushinge ko igiciro c’izina muhungu ari hagati y’imyaka mirongo ibiri na mirongo itandatu gihuye na shekeli mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 575.</char></note> z’ifeza, hakoreshejwe ingero shekeli y’Ahera; <verse eid="LEV 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />niyaba ari umuntu w’igitsina gore, muze mushinge shekeli mirongo itatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 345.</char></note> <verse eid="LEV 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />Niyaba umuntu ari hagati y’imyaka itanu na mirongo ibiri, muze mushinge igiciro c’umuhungu kuri shekeli mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 230.</char></note> na shekeli icumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 115.</char></note> ku mukobwa. <verse eid="LEV 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />Niyaba ari umuntu ari hagati y’ukwezi kumwe n’imyaka itanu, ku muhungu muze mushinge shekeli zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 58.</char></note> na shekeli zitatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 35.</char></note> z’ifeza ku mukobwa. <verse eid="LEV 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />Niyaba ari umuntu afise imyaka mirongo itandatu n’iyirenga, muze mushinge shekeli icumi na zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 175.</char></note> ku mugabo na shekeli icumi z’ifeza ku mugore. <verse eid="LEV 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />Uwagize iyo ndahiro niyaba ari umukene cane ku buryo atoshobora kuriha ico kiguzi cashinzwe, aze azane uwo muntu ku muherezi, na we aze amushingire igiciro gihwanye n’ico nyene gusezerana ashobora kuronka.<verse eid="LEV 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />Ico yasezeranye nicaba ari igikoko cemewe gutangwako ikimazi gishikanirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ico gikoko gihawe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kizoba kibaye icera. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />Ntaze akiguze n’ikindi, ari ciza ngo agisubirize na kibi canke ari kibi ngo agisubirize na ciza; bikenewe ko asubiriza ico gikoko, caba ico gusubirizwa canke ikigisubirira, vyompi bizoba bibaye ivyera. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />Niyaba ico yasezeranye ari igihumanye, kidashobora gushikanirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’ikimazi, ico gikoko kize kizanirwe umuherezi, <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />na we aze arabe uko kimeze ko ari ciza canke kibi. Igiciro uwo muherezi azoshinga ico ari co cose kizoba ari ico nyene. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Nyeneco niyashaka kugicungura, aze yongereko ikigira gatanu c’igiciro caco.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />Umuntu niyatanga inzu yiwe ngo ibe iyerejwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, umuherezi aze avuge ko ari nziza canke ari mbi. Igiciro ico ari co cose umuherezi azoshinga kizoguma ari ico nyene. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Uwo muntu nyene kuyitanga niyagomba kuyicungura, aze yongereko ica gatanu ku giciro cayo, iyo nzu rero izoheza isubire kumwegukira.<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />Umuntu niyatanga igice c’itongo ry’umuryango wiwe ngo ribe iryerejwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, igiciro caryo kize gishingwe baravye imbuto ziterwa muri ryo uko zingana: shekeli mirongo itanu ku ngero homeru imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 135.</char></note> ya sayiri. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Niyatanga iryo tongo mu mwaka wa Yubile, igiciro cashinzwe kizoguma ari ico nyene. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Ariko niyatanga iryo tongo inyuma ya Yubile, umuherezi aze ashinge igiciro yisunze imyaka isigaye kugira ngo Yubile yindi ishike, kugira ngo igiciro caryo kigabanurwe. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />Uwo muntu yaritanze niyagomba kuricungura, aze yongereko ica gatanu c’igiciro caryo, hanyuma iryo tongo rize risubire kumwegukira. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Ariko natacungura iryo tongo, canke niyaba yarigurishije n’uwundi, ntirize ryigere ricungurwa. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Igihe iryo tongo rizosubirizwa kuri Yubile, rizoca riba iryera, nk’uko bigenda kw’itongo ryeguriwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; rizoca riba iry’abaherezi.<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />Umuntu niyatanga itongo yaguze ngo ribe iryerejwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, itongo atari iry’umuryango, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />umuherezi aze ashinge igiciro caryo aharuye imyaka isigaye ngo Yubile ishike, hanyuma uwo muntu aze arihe ico kiguzi kuri uwo musi nyene nk’ikintu cerejwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Mu mwaka wa Yubile iryo tongo rizoca risubizwa nyene kurigurisha, nyeneryo imbere y’uko rigurishwa. <verse eid="LEV 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />Ikiguzi cose kize gishingwe hakoreshejwe ingero shekeli y’Ahera, ingero gera mirongo ibiri zibe shekeli imwe.<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />Ariko ntihaze hagire n’umwe azotanga igikoko c’uburiza, kuko ivy’uburiza vyose bisanzwe ari ivy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; yaba inka, canke intama, ni ivy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />Nicaba ari kimwe mu bikoko bihumanye, ashobora kugitangira ikiguzi cashinzwe, akongerako ica gatanu caco. Natagicungura, kize kigurishwe ku giciro cashinzwe.<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />Ariko ntihaze hagire ikintu na kimwe ceguriwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yaba umuntu canke igikoko canke itongo ry’umuryango, kizogurishwa canke ngo gicungurwe; ikintu cose ceguriwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kizoba ari icera cane k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="LEV 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />Naho yoba ari umuntu yeguriwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo yicwe, ntaze acungurwe; aze yicwe.<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />Ikigiracumi c’ibintu vyose biva mu mirima, vyaba ivyo mu kuzimu canke ivyama ku biti, ni ic’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; kandi ni icera k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Umuntu niyacungura na kimwe mu bigiracumi, aze yongereko ica gatanu c’igiciro caco. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Ikigiracumi gikwiye co mu masho no mu mikuku, ni ukuvuga ikigiracumi mu vyo umwungere aharuye biciye musi y’inkoni yiwe, kizoba ari icera k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Ntaze atoranyemwo nziza muri mbi canke ngo agire iyo asubiriza iyindi. Niyagira iyo asubiriza, iyasubirijwe n’iyayisubiriye zose zizoba ari izera kandi ntizize zicungurwe.’ ”<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Ayo ni yo mategeko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yahaye Mose ku musozi Sinayi ngo ayashikirize Abisirayeli.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>